            "value": "レビュー済みバンドでの練習を終了し、アクティビティの従来の設定を開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full requested count is unavailable at the shown challenge. Review the reasons and choose an alternative.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The full requested count is unavailable at the shown challenge. Review the reasons and choose an alternative."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示中の難易度では、希望する問題数を利用できません。理由を確認し、別の選択肢を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your selected challenge does not match the current activity, field, language, profile or reviewed catalog. Choose an alternative explicitly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your selected challenge does not match the current activity, field, language, profile or reviewed catalog. Choose an alternative explicitly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した難易度は、現在のアクティビティ・分野・言語・プロフィール・レビュー済みカタログに対応していません。別の選択肢を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saving your work…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saving your work…"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学習内容を保存中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answer changed while saving. Review it and try the action again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your answer changed while saving. Review it and try the action again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存中に解答が変更されました。内容を確認し、もう一度操作してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your latest work was written, but storage verification did not finish. Keep this session open and retry saving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your latest work was written, but storage verification did not finish. Keep this session open and retry saving."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最新の学習内容は書き込まれましたが、保存状態の確認が完了していません。このセッションを開いたまま、もう一度保存してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved work is busy. Your work is retained. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved work is busy. Your work is retained. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存データを処理中です。学習内容は保持されています。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This saved solid section needs a compatible version. Its original question and response remain saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This saved solid section needs a compatible version. Its original question and response remain saved."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この保存済みの立体の断面には対応するバージョンが必要です。元の問題と回答は保存されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "    visit(v)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "    visit(v)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訪問(v)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  for v in neighbors[u] {": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  for v in neighbors[u] {"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隣人のvのために[u] {"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  visited.insert(u)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  visited.insert(u)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訪問した。挿入(u)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  }": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  }"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " A counterexample must satisfy the premise and falsify the conclusion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 反例は前提を満たし、結論を反証する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " A reasonable range is accepted; focus on the assumptions and order of magnitude.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 妥当な範囲であれば正解とします。仮定とオーダー（桁）に注目してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Accuracy is authoritative; speed is recorded separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 正確さを正解判定に用い、速さは別に記録します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Apply the stated functional relationship, not a surface-word heuristic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 表面的な単語のヒューリスティックではなく、明示された関数関係を適用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Because a equals b, the proposed divisor is zero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " a は b に等しいため、提案された約数はゼロになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Calibration compares stated confidence with outcomes on a defined item family.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " キャリブレーションでは、規定された確信度と、定義されたアイテム ファミリの結果を比較します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Candidate patches were checked against empty, singleton, and multi-element arrays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 候補パッチは、空の配列、シングルトン配列、および複数要素の配列に対してチェックされました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Choose efficiency for this number structure, not a universally preferred method.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 普遍的に好まれる方法ではなく、この数値構造の効率を選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Compare operation-count functions as input size varies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 入力サイズが異なる場合の操作カウント関数を比較します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Convert the rational value without changing its scale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " スケールを変更せずに有理数値を変換します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Determine the face whose folded normal points opposite %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 折り畳まれた法線が %1$@ の反対側を向いている面を決定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Distinguish an observed contrast from a causal or universal conclusion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 観察されたコントラストと因果的または普遍的な結論を区別します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Estimate, plausibility judgment, and exact response are captured as separate fields in that order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 推定、妥当性の判断、正確な応答は、この順序で別個のフィールドとして取得されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Expected value is a long-run weighted average, not the most likely single outcome.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 期待値は長期的な加重平均であり、最も可能性の高い単一の結果ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Identify the first operation that controls plausibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 妥当性を制御する最初の操作を特定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Interpret uncertainty without turning it into certainty or causation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 不確実性を確実性や因果関係に変えずに解釈します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Multiple design safeguards may be required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 複数の設計上の保護措置が必要になる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Multiples of 4 are even, but 2 and 6 are even without being divisible by 4.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 4 の倍数は偶数ですが、2 と 6 は 4 で割り切れず偶数です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Plausibility and exact unit conversion are stored as separate response fields.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 妥当性と正確な単位変換は、別個の応答フィールドとして保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Preserve operation order and intermediate state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 操作の順序と中間状態を保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Preserve the mass dimension while changing the metric scale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " メートルスケールを変更しながら質量寸法を維持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Report one decimal place; small rounding differences are accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 小数点以下 1 桁を報告します。多少の丸め誤差は許容されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Separate within-subject noise from a causal change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 被験者内のノイズを因果関係の変化から分離します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Solve by the inverse operation, then verify forward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 逆演算で解き、順方向を検証します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Surface structure may change; the relevant constraints must be checked again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 表面構造は変化する可能性があります。関連する制約を再度確認する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The bounded internal AST is interpreted; user text and imported code are never executed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 制限された内部 AST が解釈されます。ユーザーテキストとインポートされたコードは決して実行されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The coefficient must be at least 1 and less than 10.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 係数は 1 以上、10 未満である必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The deterministic key follows dependency order, not stylistic preference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 決定論的キーは、スタイルの好みではなく、依存関係の順序に従います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The hypotheses are deterministic state labels; the answer depends on their contrasting predictions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 仮説は決定論的な状態ラベルです。答えは彼らの対照的な予測によって決まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The physical dimension remains length; only the scale changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 物理的な寸法は長さのままです。スケールだけが変わります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The preference change takes effect after reopening.": {
      "comment": "Structured private-iCloud configuration restart suffix.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 設定の変更は、開き直した後に反映されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The seeded figure encodes means and intervals separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " シードされた数値は、平均と区間を別々にエンコードします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The sequence preserves question, method, result, and limitation as separate evidence fields.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " このシーケンスでは、質問、方法、結果、制限が個別の証拠フィールドとして保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The structured scenario has edges baseline ability → treatment and baseline ability → outcome.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 構造化されたシナリオには、ベースライン能力→治療とベースライン能力→結果というエッジがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " The useful experiment changes A independently and checks the outcome with a separate calibrated measurement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 有用な実験では、A を独立して変更し、別の校正された測定値で結果を確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " This bundled fallback uses a reviewed general-domain fact.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " このバンドルされたフォールバックは、レビューされた一般ドメインのファクトを使用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " This fallback uses a bundled, locally verified retrieval contract.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " This fallback uses a bundled, locally verified retrieval contract."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " このフォールバックでは、内蔵されたローカル検証済みの検索問題を使用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " This is an educational review of a seeded fictional report, not real research advice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " これは、シードされた架空のレポートの教育的なレビューであり、実際の研究に関するアドバイスではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Tool judgment is scored, not maximal mental effort.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 最大限の精神的努力ではなく、ツールの判断がスコア化されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Use natural frequencies to keep the base rate visible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 固有振動数を使用して、基本レートを表示し続けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Use the visible number structure instead of long multiplication.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 長い乗算の代わりに、表示される数値構造を使用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " [unsupported %lld]": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " [裏づけなし %1$lld]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " from “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
