    "100,000×10×250=250,000,000 passenger-km=2.5×10⁸. Doubling distance gives 5×10⁸: the coefficient doubles from 2.5 to 5 while the normalized scientific-notation exponent remains 8.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "100,000×10×250=250,000,000 passenger-km=2.5×10⁸. Doubling distance gives 5×10⁸: the coefficient doubles from 2.5 to 5 while the normalized scientific-notation exponent remains 8."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "100,000×10×250=250,000,000乗路km=2.5×10⁸。距離を倍増すると、5×10⁸が得られます。係数は2.5から5に倍増し、正規科学記号指数は8のままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
