    "A 2 kg cart moving at 6 m/s sticks to a stationary 1 kg cart on a level low-friction track. Using momentum conservation, what common speed in m/s follows? Return only the number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 2 kg cart moving at 6 m/s sticks to a stationary 1 kg cart on a level low-friction track. Using momentum conservation, what common speed in m/s follows? Return only the number."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6m/sで動く2kgのカートが、水平な低摩擦軌道上の静止した1kgのカートにくっつきます。慣性保存法を用いて、m/sで何という一般的な速度が続くか？数字だけを返します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 20 kN tensile load acts on a 400 mm² specimen. Compute engineering stress in MPa.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 20 kN tensile load acts on a 400 mm² specimen. Compute engineering stress in MPa."
