            "value": "20kNの引張荷重が400 mm²の試物に作用します。工程応力をMPaで計算します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 2×3 matrix multiplies a 3-component vector, so x must lie in ℝ³; then Ax lies in ℝ². Ax is undefined for x∈ℝ² because the inner dimensions 3 and 2 do not match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 2×3 matrix multiplies a 3-component vector, so x must lie in ℝ³; then Ax lies in ℝ². Ax is undefined for x∈ℝ² because the inner dimensions 3 and 2 do not match."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2×3行列は3成分ベクトルを乗じるため、xはℝ³にあり、Axはℝ²にあり、Axはx∈ℝ²では未定義です。これは、内部寸法3と2が一致しないためです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 3 kg sled starts at 2 m/s and a constant 9 N forward force acts through 4 m on level ice. Friction does −6 J of work. Using the work–energy relation, return only the final speed in m/s, rounded to three decimal places.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 3 kg sled starts at 2 m/s and a constant 9 N forward force acts through 4 m on level ice. Friction does −6 J of work. Using the work–energy relation, return only the final speed in m/s, rounded to three decimal places."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3kgのそりで2m/sから始動し、水平氷上で4mにわたって一定の9Nの前方力が作用します。摩擦は−6Jの仕事量を行います。仕事量-エネルギーの関係式を使用して、最終速度のみをm/sで返還し、小数点後3桁に丸めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 3:1 segregation ratio": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 3:1 segregation ratio"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
