          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 3D model point P=(2,−1,5) is viewed by orthographic projection along the z-axis onto the xy-plane. Return its 2D screen coordinate, state which coordinate the viewpoint discards, and name one consequence for points in this view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 3D model point P=(2,−1,5) is viewed by orthographic projection along the z-axis onto the xy-plane. Return its 2D screen coordinate, state which coordinate the viewpoint discards, and name one consequence for points in this view."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3Dモデルの点P=(2,−1,5)は、xy平面上のz軸に沿って正接投射によって表示されます。その2Dスクリーン座標を返し、ビューポイントを却下する状態を指示し、このビュー内の点の結果を1つ指定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 6 kg cart experiences a net force of 18 N. Using F = ma, what is its acceleration in m/s²? Return only the number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 6 kg cart experiences a net force of 18 N. Using F = ma, what is its acceleration in m/s²? Return only the number."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6kgのカートは18Nの正負の力を受ける。F = maを使用すると、m/s²での加速度はいくつですか？数字だけを返してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 90 Hz sinusoid is sampled at 120 samples/s. What first-zone alias frequency appears?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 90 Hz sinusoid is sampled at 120 samples/s. What first-zone alias frequency appears?"
