          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 95% confidence interval for a mean difference is [1.2,4.8]. Using the corresponding two-sided 5% test under the same model and method, does the interval include 0 and what conclusion follows?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 95% confidence interval for a mean difference is [1.2,4.8]. Using the corresponding two-sided 5% test under the same model and method, does the interval include 0 and what conclusion follows?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平均差の95%信頼区間は[1.2,4.8]。同じモデルと方法で対応する両側5%テストを使用すると、その区間には0が含まれていて、次の結論はどのようなものですか？"
