    "A Mendelian ratio describes a probability model; finite offspring counts need not equal it exactly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A Mendelian ratio describes a probability model; finite offspring counts need not equal it exactly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メンデル比は確率モデルを表します。有限数の子について、観測比が理論比と厳密に一致する必要はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bag contains 5 red and 3 blue tokens. Two tokens are drawn without replacement. What is the probability both are red? Round to four decimal places.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bag contains 5 red and 3 blue tokens. Two tokens are drawn without replacement. What is the probability both are red? Round to four decimal places."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "袋には5つの赤と3つの青のトークンが入っています。2つのトークンは交換なしで引かれます。どちらも赤の確率はどれですか？小数点四舍五入します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bakery recipe makes 12 rolls from 750 g flour. A cafeteria needs 30 rolls. What flour amount should be transferred to the larger batch, and which invariant makes the transfer valid?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bakery recipe makes 12 rolls from 750 g flour. A cafeteria needs 30 rolls. What flour amount should be transferred to the larger batch, and which invariant makes the transfer valid?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パン屋のレシピでは、小麦粉750gから12ロールが作れます。カフェテリアでは30ロールが必要です。どの小麦粉量を大きなバッチに転送し、どの不変量が転送を有効にする必要がありますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A balanced-equation ratio is directional. Writing units on the factor makes the incorrect reciprocal visible before arithmetic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A balanced-equation ratio is directional. Writing units on the factor makes the incorrect reciprocal visible before arithmetic."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平衡式比率は方向性があります。係数に単位を書くと、算式前に不正確な逆数を明らかにできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bar chart’s vertical axis spans 90 to 99, and the two bars end at 96 and 99. Compute the actual value difference and explain why the cropped axis can exaggerate it visually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bar chart’s vertical axis spans 90 to 99, and the two bars end at 96 and 99. Compute the actual value difference and explain why the cropped axis can exaggerate it visually."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "バーチャートの垂直軸は90から99に広がり、2本のバーは96と99で終わります。実際の値の違いを計算し、トリミングされた軸が視覚的にそれを誇張する理由を説明します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A binary search tree ordered by action text": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A binary search tree ordered by action text"
          }
        },
