        }
      }
    },
    "Accuracy establishes predictive association in the evaluated population, not that intervening on the predictor changes readmission. Test the causal claim with an ethical randomized intervention on a manipulable exposure, or a defensible quasi-experiment that blocks confounding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accuracy establishes predictive association in the evaluated population, not that intervening on the predictor changes readmission. Test the causal claim with an ethical randomized intervention on a manipulable exposure, or a defensible quasi-experiment that blocks confounding."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精度は、予測因子が再入院を変更することではなく、評価された集団における予測関連性を確立します。操作可能な曝露に対する倫理的なランダム化介入、または混乱をブロックする防御可能な準実験を使用して、因果関係の主張をテストします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accuracy first": {
