        }
      }
    },
    "Across six monthly surveys, rainfall is [20, 80, 25, 85, 30, 90] mm and algal biomass is [5, 6, 18, 7, 20, 8] g/m². What lag pattern is visible, and what can this time series not establish by itself?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Across six monthly surveys, rainfall is [20, 80, 25, 85, 30, 90] mm and algal biomass is [5, 6, 18, 7, 20, 8] g/m². What lag pattern is visible, and what can this time series not establish by itself?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6か月の調査では、降水量[20、80、25、85、30、90]mm、藻類バイオマス[5、6、18、7、20、8]g/m²です。どのようなラグパターンが見えますか、そしてこの時間系列はそれ自体によって確立できないものは何ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
