    "All treated samples are processed Monday and all controls Friday. How should processing be redesigned, and what threat does the original layout create?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All treated samples are processed Monday and all controls Friday. How should processing be redesigned, and what threat does the original layout create?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "処理されたサンプルのすべては月曜日、すべてのコントロールは金曜日に処理されます。処理をどのように再設計すべきですか、また元のレイアウトはどのような脅威をもたらしますか？"
          }
