          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any hypothetical shorter path to u would have to cross from the finalized set through a vertex whose tentative key is smaller than u’s. That contradicts removing u as the current minimum; nonnegative edges are essential to this argument.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "u へのより短い仮想経路は、確定済み集合から u より小さい暫定キーを持つ頂点を通って境界を越える必要があります。これは u を現在の最小として取り出したことに矛盾し、この議論には非負の辺が不可欠です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any reagent, temperature, or operator difference between Monday and Friday is perfectly aligned with treatment and cannot be separated afterward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any reagent, temperature, or operator difference between Monday and Friday is perfectly aligned with treatment and cannot be separated afterward."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月曜日と金曜日間の試薬、温度、オペレーターの違いは、治療に完全に適合しており、その後は分離できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App language": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリ言語"
          }
        }
      }
    },
