          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assigning every treatment sample to one batch and every control to another confounds treatment with batch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Assigning every treatment sample to one batch and every control to another confounds treatment with batch."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての処理サンプルのバッチに割り当て、すべてのコントロールを別のバッチに割り当てると、処理とバッチが混同されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assignment": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "割り当て"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assignments use the current value. Changing x at the end does not change the value already stored in y.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assignments use the current value. Changing x at the end does not change the value already stored in y."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代入では、その時点の値を使います。最後にxを変えても、すでにyに保存された値は変わりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assisted practice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assisted practice"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "補助を使った練習"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assume a = b with a nonzero": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0ではないaとbについて、a = bと仮定する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assume the new context uses the same units without checking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しいコンテキストはチェックせずに同じ単位を使用すると仮定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assume the statement for every integer without proving a base case.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基底事例を証明せずに、すべての整数について命題を仮定する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assume the statement for k, then use that assumption to establish the statement for k + 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "k について命題を仮定し、その仮定を使って k + 1 について命題を示す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assume √2=a/b with coprime integers a,b. Then a²=2b², so a is even: a=2k. Substitution gives b²=2k², so b is also even, contradicting that a/b was in lowest terms.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assume √2=a/b with coprime integers a,b. Then a²=2b², so a is even: a=2k. Substitution gives b²=2k², so b is also even, contradicting that a/b was in lowest terms."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整除可能な整数a、bで√2=a/bと仮定します。 次に、a²=2b²、したがってaは偶数です：a=2k。 代入すると、b²=2k²、したがってbも偶数であり、a/bが最下位であったことと矛盾します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assumptions, edge cases, and state tracking": {
      "comment": "Description of the Logic and Debugging lab.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仮定、特殊なケース、および状態の追跡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At %@ = %@, the condition is %@ because `%@` is %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "At %@ = %@, the condition is %@ because `%@` is %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ = %@では、条件は%@です。`%@`が%@だからです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At 300 K a rate is 1.2 units; at 320 K it is 2.4 units under otherwise identical conditions. Compute the rate ratio and state the observed temperature effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At 300 K a rate is 1.2 units; at 320 K it is 2.4 units under otherwise identical conditions. Compute the rate ratio and state the observed temperature effect."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "300Kでは比率は1.2単位です。320Kでは、それ以外は同じ条件の下で2.4単位です。比率比を計算し、観測された温度効果を述べてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At V=3, T=20×3−5=55. V=6 lies outside the calibrated [0,5] range, so the formula cannot be transferred without validating extrapolation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At V=3, T=20×3−5=55. V=6 lies outside the calibrated [0,5] range, so the formula cannot be transferred without validating extrapolation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V=3、T=20×3−5=55である。V=6はキャリブレーションされた[0,5]範囲の外にあり、したがって、外延を検証することなく式を転送することはできない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At constant pressure, W = PΔV = 100,000 × 0.020 = 2,000 J.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At constant pressure, W = PΔV = 100,000 × 0.020 = 2,000 J."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一定の圧力で、W = PΔV = 100,000 × 0.020 = 2,000 J。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At constant speed, %lld × %lld = %lld meters. The horizontal coordinate is the requested time, not the distance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At constant speed, %lld × %lld = %lld meters. The horizontal coordinate is the requested time, not the distance."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一定の速さなので、%lld × %lld = %lldメートルです。横軸の座標は指定された時間を表し、距離ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At equilibrium for a reversible reaction, which statement is correct?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At equilibrium for a reversible reaction, which statement is correct?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可逆反応の平衡状態において、正しいのはどの文ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At every transformation, check domain restrictions such as nonzero divisors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各変形で、除数が0でないことなど、定義域の制約を確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least one claim is paired with evidence of the wrong scope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "少なくとも 1 つのクレームが、間違った範囲の証拠と組み合わされています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least one goal stays selected so practice has a useful starting point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "少なくとも1つの目標が選択されたままになるため、練習の開始点として役立ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least one local input sample is recorded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "少なくとも1つのローカル入力サンプルが記録されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least one selected action copies an unchecked assumption or misses a required validation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択したアクションの少なくとも 1 つが、未チェックの仮定をコピーするか、必要な検証を見逃します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At most about 33,000 boxes before packing losses; 10 million is roughly 300 times too large.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most about 33,000 boxes before packing losses; 10 million is roughly 300 times too large."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "損失を包摂する前の最大で約33,000箱、1000万箱は300倍ほど大きいです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At n=1 both sides equal 1. Using the induction hypothesis Sₖ=k(k+1)/2, Sₖ₊₁=Sₖ+(k+1)=k(k+1)/2+(k+1)=(k+1)(k+2)/2.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At n=1 both sides equal 1. Using the induction hypothesis Sₖ=k(k+1)/2, Sₖ₊₁=Sₖ+(k+1)=k(k+1)/2+(k+1)=(k+1)(k+2)/2."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "n=1で、両側は1に等しい。誘導仮説Sₖ=k(k+1)/2を使用すると、Sₖ₊₁=Sₖ+(k+1)=k(k+1)/2+(k+1)=(k+1)(k+2)/2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At steady state for production−degradation×mRNA=0, mRNA=production/degradation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At steady state for production−degradation×mRNA=0, mRNA=production/degradation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生産-分解×mRNA=0の安定状態では、mRNA=生産/分解。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At the root in place of 8": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the root in place of 8"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8の根元に"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At x zero, y is %lld; each increase of one in x raises y by %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "At x zero, y is %1$lld; each increase of one in x raises y by %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "x がゼロの場合、y は %1$lld です。 x が 1 増加するたびに、y は %2$lld ずつ増加します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At x=0, two equal-frequency signals reach maxima at t=0 and t=0.25 s; their period is 1.0 s. Compute the smaller phase separation in degrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At x=0, two equal-frequency signals reach maxima at t=0 and t=0.25 s; their period is 1.0 s. Compute the smaller phase separation in degrees."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "x=0で、2つの等周波数信号がt=0とt=0.25秒で最大値に達します。その周波数は1.0秒です。度あたりの小さい位相差を計算します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At x=−2 the premise x²=4 is true while the conclusion x=2 is false. The tempting x=2 confirms the claim instead of refuting it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At x=−2 the premise x²=4 is true while the conclusion x=2 is false. The tempting x=2 confirms the claim instead of refuting it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "x=−2であるとき、前提条件x²=4は真であり、結論x=2は誤りです。誘惑的なx=2は、その主張を反駁するのではなく、その主張を肯定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach a unique operation ID and commit the balance change with an idempotency record in one transaction.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
