    "Audit the cited scoring term `%@`. If %@ = 1 and every other additive term is held at zero, what contribution does this term make? Explain why changing multiplication to division would violate the stated linear weighting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Audit the cited scoring term `%@`. If %@ = 1 and every other additive term is held at zero, what contribution does this term make? Explain why changing multiplication to division would violate the stated linear weighting."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引用された採点項`%@`を監査してください。%@ = 1で、ほかの加算項をすべてゼロにしたとき、この項の寄与はいくつですか？乗算を除算に変えると、明示された線形重み付けに反する理由を説明してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audit the first decisive step": {
