    "Base case: S₁ = 1 = 1(1 + 1)/2. Assume Sₖ = k(k + 1)/2. Then Sₖ₊₁ = Sₖ + (k + 1) = k(k + 1)/2 + (k + 1) = (k + 1)(k + 2)/2, which is the claimed formula with k replaced by k + 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基底事例：S₁ = 1 = 1(1 + 1)/2。Sₖ = k(k + 1)/2 と仮定します。すると Sₖ₊₁ = Sₖ + (k + 1) = k(k + 1)/2 + (k + 1) = (k + 1)(k + 2)/2 となり、これは k を k + 1 に置き換えた主張の式です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
