          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベースラインの能力は治療の選択と結果の両方に影響を与えるため、観察されたコントラストには治療とベースラインの違いが混在します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Baseline ability predicts both treatment choice and the measured outcome.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベースライン能力は、治療の選択と測定された結果の両方を予測します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Baseline complete": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベースラインが完了しました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Basic fluency": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本的な流暢さ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Because 1 m = 1,000 mm, 1 m² = 1,000² mm²; therefore 0.006 × 1,000,000 = 6,000 mm².": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Because 1 m = 1,000 mm, 1 m² = 1,000² mm²; therefore 0.006 × 1,000,000 = 6,000 mm²."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1m=1,000mm、1m²=1,000²mm²なので、0.006×1,000,000=6,000²mm²です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Because A is invertible, multiply Ax = 0 by A⁻¹ on the left: A⁻¹Ax = A⁻¹0, hence Ix = 0 and x = 0. Therefore the null space is trivial.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A は可逆なので、Ax = 0 の左から A⁻¹ を掛けます。A⁻¹Ax = A⁻¹0 より Ix = 0、したがって x = 0 です。よって零空間は自明です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Because Q<K, the reaction must increase the product-to-reactant ratio, so it proceeds right. The nearest distractor uses the Q>K direction backward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Because Q<K, the reaction must increase the product-to-reactant ratio, so it proceeds right. The nearest distractor uses the Q>K direction backward."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Q<Kであるため、反応物は生成物対反応物の比率を増加させなければならないため、正しい方向に進行します。最も近い変数はQ>K方向を逆行します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Because the solute is the same and does not react, total solute is 0.100×1.0 + 0.100×3.0 = 0.400 mol in 0.200 L, so M = 2.0.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Because the solute is the same and does not react, total solute is 0.100×1.0 + 0.100×3.0 = 0.400 mol in 0.200 L, so M = 2.0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "溶質は同じであり反応しないため、溶質の合計は0.100×1.0 + 0.100×3.0 = 0.400 mol in 0.200 Lなので、M = 2.0です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
