    "Boolean": {
      "comment": "Inferred CSV column type.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ブール値"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both are constant time because n is fixed for one run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 回の実行では n が固定であるため、どちらも定数時間になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both are optional, private by default, and reversible from this screen.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらもオプションであり、デフォルトでは非公開であり、この画面から元に戻すことができます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both contain numbers": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらにも数字が含まれています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both graphs have output → next-input edges with one-step delay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両方のグラフには、出力→次の入力エッジがあり、1 ステップの遅延があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both have the same growth because both return one result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらも 1 つの結果を返すため、どちらも同じ成長を示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both parents are heterozygous carriers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both parents are heterozygous carriers."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両親はヘテロ接合体のキャリアです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both parents are homozygous dominant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both parents are homozygous dominant."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両親は単倍体優勢です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both plotted coordinates satisfy the stated target and constant-speed relationship": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both plotted coordinates satisfy the stated target and constant-speed relationship"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点の両方の座標が、指定された目標と一定の速さの関係を満たしている"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both reaction rates are zero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both reaction rates are zero."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反応速度は両方ともゼロです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both representations contain the pairs two to six and four to twelve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらの表現にも、2 ～ 6 と 4 ～ 12 のペアが含まれています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both sides contain the factor a minus b": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両辺には因数 a から b を引いた値が含まれます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both systems contain a feedback relation in which output changes later input.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらのシステムにも、入力の後に出力が変化するフィードバック関係が含まれています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both tasks accumulate a total from a constant rate over time, starting from zero with no loss. The output nouns change, but multiplying a rate by a matching duration still gives the accumulated output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both tasks accumulate a total from a constant rate over time, starting from zero with no loss. The output nouns change, but multiplying a rate by a matching duration still gives the accumulated output."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらの課題も、初めの量がゼロで、途中で失われる分がなく、一定のレートで時間とともに量が増えます。出力するものの名前は変わりますが、レートに同じ単位で表した時間を掛けると、累積した出力量を求められます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both views preserve the same input-output pairs despite the representation change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらのビューでも、表現が変更されたにもかかわらず、同じ入出力ペアが保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bound the number of breaths one person takes in a day if a plausible resting rate is 12–20 breaths/minute. Give the numerical interval and its order of magnitude, and state what the bound omits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bound the number of breaths one person takes in a day if a plausible resting rate is 12–20 breaths/minute. Give the numerical interval and its order of magnitude, and state what the bound omits."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "妥当な安静用量が12〜20回/分である場合、1日に1人が取る呼吸数の数を制限します。数値区間とその振る舞いを指定し、制限が省略するものを述べてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boundary and edge-case debugging": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "境界およびエッジケースのデバッグ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boundary audit for the cited condition `%@`: evaluate it when %@ equals %@, then explain whether the threshold itself is included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Boundary audit for the cited condition `%@`: evaluate it when %@ equals %@, then explain whether the threshold itself is included."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引用された条件`%@`の境界を監査します。%@が%@に等しい場合を評価し、しきい値自体が含まれるか説明してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boundary reasoning": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "境界推論"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bounded traces and authored logic items use explicit expected states or choices. Pseudocode executes only in the restricted local interpreter.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "境界付きトレースおよび作成されたロジック項目では、明示的に予期される状態または選択肢が使用されます。擬似コードは、制限されたローカル インタプリタでのみ実行されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Breadth-first traversal finishes the current layer before the next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breadth-first traversal finishes the current layer before the next."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "幅優先トラバースは、次のレイヤーよりも前のレイヤーを終了します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break an unfamiliar quantity into factors, estimate it, and test the scale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知の量を要因に分けて推定し、桁が妥当か確かめます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break-even sets contribution equal to fixed cost: 30n = 1,200, so n = 40.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Break-even sets contribution equal to fixed cost: 30n = 1,200, so n = 40."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "損益分岐点は固定費用に等しい貢献をセットします：30n = 1,200、したがってn = 40。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brief reflection": {
      "comment": "Fallback title for an item-level reflection.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簡単な振り返り"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brings NeuroForge forward and opens Today. Any active session remains open, and saved unfinished blocks can be resumed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NeuroForgeを前面に表示し、「今日」を開きます。進行中のセッションはそのまま開いた状態になり、保存済みの未完了ブロックは再開できます。"
