          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生徒が2つのグループに入る方法を変更します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change index <= count to index < count; count is one past the final valid zero-based index.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "index <= countをindex < countに変更します。countは、0始まりの最後の有効な添字の1つ先です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change index <= count to index < count; valid zero-based indices end at count−1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change index <= count to index < count; valid zero-based indices end at count−1."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インデックス<=カウントをインデックス<カウントに変更します。有効なゼロベースのインデックスはカウント−1で終了します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change one target factor while holding boundary conditions and measurement procedure fixed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Change one target factor while holding boundary conditions and measurement procedure fixed."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "境界条件と測定手順を固定したまま、1つのターゲットファクターを変更します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change plus to minus and convert entropy units if needed: ΔG=ΔH−TΔS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change plus to minus and convert entropy units if needed: ΔG=ΔH−TΔS."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必要に応じて、ΔG=ΔH−TΔSをマイナスに変換し、エントロピー単位を変換します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change recall": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更のリコール"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the complexity claim to O(n); the loop visits every one of n elements once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the complexity claim to O(n); the loop visits every one of n elements once."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複雑さの主張をO(n)に変更します。ループはn要素のそれぞれを一度訪れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the condition to index < count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "条件をインデックス < カウントに変更します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the condition to index <= count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "条件をindex <= countに変更する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the source of ambiguity, not only the sample size or measurement precision.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Change the source of ambiguity, not only the sample size or measurement precision."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サンプルサイズや測定精度だけでなく、曖昧さのソースを変更します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the time bound to O(log n); multiplicative growth reaches n after about log₂n doublings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the time bound to O(log n); multiplicative growth reaches n after about log₂n doublings."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O(log n)に時間バウンドを変更します。乗法成長率は、log₂n倍後約でnに達します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the time bound to O(n²); each of n outer iterations performs n inner iterations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the time bound to O(n²); each of n outer iterations performs n inner iterations."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O(n²)に時間バウンドを変更します。nつの外側の反復ごとにnつの内側の反復が実行されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change what the scorer can see besides the image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change what the scorer can see besides the image."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スコアラーが画像以外に表示できるものを変更します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change wording only after identifying what cannot change in meaning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change wording only after identifying what cannot change in meaning."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "意味を変えてはいけない部分を特定してから、表現を言い換えてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changed"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更あり"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes affect future scheduling and field context. They never rewrite past attempts or assessment evidence.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更は将来のスケジュールとフィールドのコンテキストに影響します。過去の試みや評価の証拠を書き換えることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes today’s workload, not your progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日のワークロードだけが変わり、進捗には影響しません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing a threshold trades false positives against false negatives; it does not improve every metric simultaneously.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Changing a threshold trades false positives against false negatives; it does not improve every metric simultaneously."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "しきい値を変更すると、誤ったネガティブに対して誤った陽性と取引されます。すべての指標が同時に改善されるわけではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing both causes together cannot separate their predictions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両方の原因を一緒に変更しても、それらの予測を分離することはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing one candidate cause at a time while holding stress and material batch fixed separates their effects. Origin imaging supplies mechanism-specific evidence rather than only another lifetime comparison.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changing one candidate cause at a time while holding stress and material batch fixed separates their effects. Origin imaging supplies mechanism-specific evidence rather than only another lifetime comparison."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1回に1つの候補の原因を変更し、ストレスと材料バッチを固定したままにしておくことで、その効果が分離されます。オリジンイメージングは、他の生涯比較ではなく、メカニズム固有の証拠を提供します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check (L/s³)(s²)=L/s, apply d/dx ∫₀ˣr(t)dt=r(x), and distinguish rate from total.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check (L/s³)(s²)=L/s, apply d/dx ∫₀ˣr(t)dt=r(x), and distinguish rate from total."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "チェック（L/s³）（s²）=L/s、d/dx ∫₀ˣr(t)dt=r(x)を適用し、レートとトータルを区別します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Q < K, Q = K, and Q > K rather than memorizing one perturbation story.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Check Q < K, Q = K, and Q > K rather than memorizing one perturbation story."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1つの摂動話を覚えるのではなく、Q < K、Q = K、および Q > Kをチェックします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a concentration ratio of one and an order of zero to expose an invalid log-ratio step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Check a concentration ratio of one and an order of zero to expose an invalid log-ratio step."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無効なログ比ステップを暴露するには、1の濃度比とゼロのオーダーをチェックします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a naive baseline, rare class, duplicated entity, and future-time split.": {
