            "value": "Check the observed contrast, the two pieces that limit causal attribution, and whether the follow-up makes both assignment and measurement comparable."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "観測された差、因果関係の判断を制限する2つの根拠、そして追試が割り当てと測定の両方を比較可能にするかを確認しましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the order or return condition in the study method.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the order or return condition in the study method."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学習方法の順序や、値を返す条件を確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the percentage base and scale before inspecting later arithmetic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "後続の計算を調べる前に、百分率の基準となる全体量と、100分の1への換算を確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the power of ten": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10の累乗を調べてください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the premise and conclusion independently for the same candidate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ候補者について前提と結論を個別に確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the product": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "積を確認する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the result": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結果を確認する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the selected operation and the intermediate value.": {
      "comment": "Generic deterministic mental-math error feedback.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した演算と中間値を確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the starting amount and losses": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the starting amount and losses"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初めの量と失われる量を確認する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the stated implication, then seek one counterexample to its converse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示された含意（「ならば」の関係）を確認し、その逆の反例を1つ探します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the zero-gain, high-gain, step-input, and disturbance limits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Check the zero-gain, high-gain, step-input, and disturbance limits."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ゼロゲイン、高ゲイン、ステップ入力、干渉限界を確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the zero-time boundary before substituting 6 s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the zero-time boundary before substituting 6 s."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6秒を置換する前に、ゼロ時間の境界をチェックしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check units, constraints, and whether the conclusion fits the evidence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単位、制約、および結論が証拠に適合するかどうかを確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check values.isEmpty before reading index 0 and return an optional or declared empty-case result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check values.isEmpty before reading index 0 and return an optional or declared empty-case result."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インデックス0を読み込む前にvalues.isEmptyをチェックし、オプションまたは宣言された空の区切り文字の結果を返す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether the claimed effect survives when the groups are compared at the same baseline risk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Check whether the claimed effect survives when the groups are compared at the same baseline risk."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ基準リスクでグループを比較した場合、主張される効果が残るかどうかを確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether the design and observation support descriptive, causal, or universal language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "研究設計と観測結果が、記述的・因果的・普遍的な表現のどこまでを裏づけるか確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check which dimensions, faces, or components remain invariant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どの寸法、面、またはコンポーネントが不変のままであるかを確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check which quantity the percentage is based on.": {
      "comment": "Deterministic mental-math feedback for a percentage-base error.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パーセンテージがどの数量に基づいているかを確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check your recall against:": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下と照らし合わせて、思い出した内容を確認してください："
