    "Color the board like a chessboard. Every domino covers one black and one white square, but opposite corners have the same color, so removing them leaves 30 squares of that color and 32 of the other. A 31-domino tiling would require 31 of each, impossible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Color the board like a chessboard. Every domino covers one black and one white square, but opposite corners have the same color, so removing them leaves 30 squares of that color and 32 of the other. A 31-domino tiling would require 31 of each, impossible."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "チェスの盤のようにボードに色を塗ります。各ドミノは黒と白の正方形を1つ覆いますが、反対の角は同じ色なので、それらを削除すると、その色の30マスと他の色32マスが残ります。31ドミノタイルはそれぞれ31を必要としますが、不可能です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Column %lld of %lld, header: %@": {
      "localizations": {
