    "Construct the free-body diagram, declare symmetry, and solve the equilibrium equation 2R=20.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Construct the free-body diagram, declare symmetry, and solve the equilibrium equation 2R=20."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自由体の図を構築し、対称性を宣言し、平衡方程式2R=20を解きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Construct the free-body model for a simply supported beam with a pin and roller under a centered 20 kN downward point load. State the assumption that makes the two vertical reactions equal, solve them, and explain what changes if the load moves off center.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Construct the free-body model for a simply supported beam with a pin and roller under a centered 20 kN downward point load. State the assumption that makes the two vertical reactions equal, solve them, and explain what changes if the load moves off center."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中心20kNの下降点荷重の下でピンとローラーを備えた単純支持ビームの自由体モデルを構築します。 2つの垂直リアクションが等しいという仮定を述べて、それらを解き、荷重が中心から移動した場合の変化を説明します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
