          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "電流には単位がC/sあるので、一貫した関係はQΔtではなくI=Q/Δtです。したがって、I=10/2=5 A。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current is charge per time, so I=Q/Δt, not QΔt. The unit is C/s=A, and 10 C/2 s=5 A.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current is charge per time, so I=Q/Δt, not QΔt. The unit is C/s=A, and 10 C/2 s=5 A."
          }
