          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可溶体を溶液体総量で割る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide solute mass by solute plus solvent mass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide solute mass by solute plus solvent mass."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "溶出物の質量を溶出物プラス溶媒質量で割ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide speed by frequency.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide speed by frequency."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "速度を周波数で割る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide stored entries by bucket count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide stored entries by bucket count."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "格納されたエントリをバケットカウントで割り当てます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide the count by its stated exposure interval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Divide the count by its stated exposure interval."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示された露出間隔でカウントを割ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide the higher-temperature rate by the lower.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide the higher-temperature rate by the lower."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "より高い温度率をより低い率で割ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide the part by the whole, then compare with familiar fractions before converting to percent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分を全体で割り、百分率に直す前に、なじみのある分数と比べます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide total amount by total interval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Divide total amount by total interval."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計金額を合計間隔で割ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide transcriptionRate by degradationRate; multiplying predicts more mRNA when degradation becomes faster.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide transcriptionRate by degradationRate; multiplying predicts more mRNA when degradation becomes faster."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "転写率を分解率で割ります。分解が速くなると、増えるmRNAを予測します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide voltage by resistance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide voltage by resistance."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "電圧に抵抗を割り当てる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divide Δa by cycle count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divide Δa by cycle count."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Δaをサイクルカウントで割る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dividing distance by time gives 20.0/4.0=5.0, and dimensional division gives metres per second.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dividing distance by time gives 20.0/4.0=5.0, and dimensional division gives metres per second."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "距離を時間で割ると、20.0/4.0=5.0になり、次元割りで秒あたりのメーターになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Divisibility by 4 is enough for evenness, but evenness does not require divisibility by 4.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "偶数であるためには 4 で割り切れれば十分ですが、偶数であるためには 4 で割り切れる必要はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Division undoes the stated multiplication, and substituting the result back reproduces the original product.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Division undoes the stated multiplication, and substituting the result back reproduces the original product."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除算は示された乗算の逆演算であり、得られた値を代入すると元の積が再現されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do every calculation mentally to maximize difficulty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "難易度を最大化するためにすべての計算を頭の中で行ってください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not ask whether evidence fits; ask how differently each hypothesis predicts it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "証拠が適合するかどうかを尋ねないでください。各仮説がどのように異なる予測をするかを尋ねます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not assume the converse of an if-then rule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「もし〜ならば」の逆を仮定しないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not average the two means equally; their run counts differ.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Do not average the two means equally; their run counts differ."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両方を等しく平均して計算しないでください。実行カウントは異なります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not confuse percentage points with percent change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do not confuse percentage points with percent change."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パーセントポイントとパーセントの変化を混同しないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not equate mRNA with protein; model translation rate and degradation, especially when translation is inhibited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do not equate mRNA with protein; model translation rate and degradation, especially when translation is inhibited."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mRNAとタンパク質を同一視しないでください。特に翻訳が阻害されたときに、翻訳率と分解をモデル化します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not infer a numerical relationship the source does not state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料に記載されていない数値関係を推測しないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not map parse failure to a valid zero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do not map parse failure to a valid zero."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解析失敗を有効なゼロにマッピングしないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not mark v finalized when it is first discovered; finalize it only when its current minimum-distance entry is popped from the priority queue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "v を最初に発見した時点では確定しないでください。現在の最小距離を持つエントリが優先度付きキューから取り出されたときだけ確定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not mutate indexed storage while iterating its original indices; filter into a new array or traverse valid removal indices in reverse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do not mutate indexed storage while iterating its original indices; filter into a new array or traverse valid removal indices in reverse."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元のインデックスを反復するときにインデックスストレージを変異しないでください。新しい配列にフィルタリングするか、逆の有効な除去インデックスをトラバースします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not stop when the target is first enqueued.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目的頂点を最初にキューへ入れた時点では終了しないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not tune on the test set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do not tune on the test set."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テストセットでチューニングしないでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not use AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AIは使用しないでください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
