          }
        }
      }
    },
    "E=σ/ε=200 MPa/0.001=200,000 MPa=200 GPa.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E=σ/ε=200 MPa/0.001=200,000 MPa=200 GPa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E=σ/ε=200 MPa/0.001=200,000 MPa=200 GPa。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each area stays separate; there is no combined score or percentile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各領域は個別に扱われ、総合スコアやパーセンタイルはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each batch currently contains only one condition.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each batch currently contains only one condition."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在、各バッチには条件が1つだけ含まれています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each branch current is 12/6=2 A. Kirchhoff’s current law gives total current 2+2=4 A (equivalently R_eq=3 Ω and 12/3=4 A).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each branch current is 12/6=2 A. Kirchhoff’s current law gives total current 2+2=4 A (equivalently R_eq=3 Ω and 12/3=4 A)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各分岐電流は12/6=2 Aです。キルヒハウアーの電流法則は、合計電流2+2=4 A（R_eq=3 Ωおよび12/3=4 Aに相当）を与えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each operation acts on the previous checkpoint, so preserving the stated order yields the final chain value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Each operation acts on the previous checkpoint, so preserving the stated order yields the final chain value."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各演算は直前の途中結果に作用するため、示された順序を守れば最終値が得られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each parent contributes a with probability 1/2, so P(aa)=1/2×1/2=1/4. The 3/4 distractor is the dominant-phenotype probability, not genotype aa.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each parent contributes a with probability 1/2, so P(aa)=1/2×1/2=1/4. The 3/4 distractor is the dominant-phenotype probability, not genotype aa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各親は確率1/2で貢献するので、P(aa)=1/2×1/2=1/4。3/4の離散者は遺伝子型aaではなく、優勢表現型の確率です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each possible reaction extent is available moles divided by its coefficient. The smaller extent is feasible for both reactants and therefore determines product yield.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各反応物が可能にする反応進行度は、利用可能なモル数をその係数で割った値です。小さい方なら両方の反応物で実現できるため、生成物の収量を決めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each proof line must use only definitions or results already established.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "証明の各行では、定義またはすでに示した結果だけを使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each record receives the same number of checks, so total work is records × checks per record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各レコードに同じ回数のチェックを行うため、総処理量はレコード数 × 1レコード当たりのチェック回数です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each resource statement becomes one inequality with coefficients tied to the tray that consumes it. Whole trays make integrality part of the model rather than a rounding step after optimization.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each resource statement becomes one inequality with coefficients tied to the tray that consumes it. Whole trays make integrality part of the model rather than a rounding step after optimization."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各リソースステートメントは、それを消費するトレイにバインドされた係数を持つ不平等になります。トレイ全体は、最適化後の丸めステップではなく、モデルの一部を整整部分にします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each review session includes up to five questions from one activity. The remaining reviews stay in your queue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each review session includes up to five questions from one activity. The remaining reviews stay in your queue."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各復習セッションには、1つの練習から最大5問が含まれます。残りの復習は一覧に残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each safeguard should block a named path from design choices to a misleading result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各セーフガードは、設計上の選択から誤解を招く結果に至るまでの名前付きパスをブロックする必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each son receives Y from the father and one maternal X; half receive the recessive maternal X. One quarter is the fraction of all children under equal sex ratio, not of sons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each son receives Y from the father and one maternal X; half receive the recessive maternal X. One quarter is the fraction of all children under equal sex ratio, not of sons."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "それぞれの息子は父親からYを受け取り、母親からXを受け取ります。半分はレシナクト母親のXを受け取ります。四分の三は、すべての子供の性別比が等しい子どもの割合であり、息子ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each workday contributes 2 × 18 = 36 km, and 36 × 220 = 7,920 km per year.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each workday contributes 2 × 18 = 36 km, and 36 × 220 = 7,920 km per year."
