    "Foundation practice and optional help are available. Your recorded level has not been lowered.": {
      "comment": "Reviewed practice challenge control; never a demonstrated ability claim.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foundation practice and optional help are available. Your recorded level has not been lowered."
