        }
      }
    },
    "From P and P → Q, Q follows; Q alone does not establish P.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "From P and P → Q, Q follows; Q alone does not establish P."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PとP→Qから、Qが続き、QだけではPを確立しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From memory, state the cited proposition precisely enough that another reader can verify every substantive part against the excerpt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From memory, state the cited proposition precisely enough that another reader can verify every substantive part against the excerpt."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "別の読者が抜粋と照合して内容をすべて確認できる精度で、引用された命題を記憶から述べてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From v = v₀ + at, write t = (v − v₀)/a. Substitute into Δx = (v + v₀)t/2 to obtain Δx = (v² − v₀²)/(2a), hence v² = v₀² + 2aΔx.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "v = v₀ + at から t = (v − v₀)/a とします。これを Δx = (v + v₀)t/2 に代入すると Δx = (v² − v₀²)/(2a) となり、したがって v² = v₀² + 2aΔx です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From y+z=0, y=−z; then x+2y+z=0 gives x=z. Thus x=z(1,−1,1), so a null-space basis is {(1,−1,1)}; multiplication gives (0,0).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From y+z=0, y=−z; then x+2y+z=0 gives x=z. Thus x=z(1,−1,1), so a null-space basis is {(1,−1,1)}; multiplication gives (0,0)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "y+z=0から、y=−z; したがって、x+2y+z=0はx=zを与えます。したがって、x=z(1,−1,1)なので、空スペース基底は{(1,−1,1)}です。乗法は(0,0)を与えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
