    "Genotype-dependent reproductive success is selection, so the no-selection assumption fails and current allele frequencies need not produce Hardy–Weinberg proportions unchanged. Random mating is required rather than a violation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Genotype-dependent reproductive success is selection, so the no-selection assumption fails and current allele frequencies need not produce Hardy–Weinberg proportions unchanged. Random mating is required rather than a violation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遺伝子型依存の生殖成功は選択であり、したがって、選択がない仮定は失敗し、現在の対立遺伝子の周波数はハーディ・ワインバーグの割合を変更する必要はありません。違反ではなく、ランダム交配が必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
