    "Group A averaged 8 points and group B averaged 6 points. Which conclusion does this comparison support?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Group A averaged 8 points and group B averaged 6 points. Which conclusion does this comparison support?"
