    "High algal biomass follows the high-rainfall months by about one month: peaks at months 3 and 5 follow rainfall peaks at months 2 and 4. This lagged association suggests a delayed forcing hypothesis but cannot establish rainfall causation without ruling out seasonal or interacting drivers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High algal biomass follows the high-rainfall months by about one month: peaks at months 3 and 5 follow rainfall peaks at months 2 and 4. This lagged association suggests a delayed forcing hypothesis but cannot establish rainfall causation without ruling out seasonal or interacting drivers."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高藻バイオマスは、降雨量の多い月を約1か月後に追随します。3月と5月のピークは、2月と4月の降雨ピークに続いています。この後方連合は遅延強制仮説を示唆しますが、季節的または相互作用するドライバーを除外することなく、降雨の原因を確立することはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High signal should activate its inhibitor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High signal should activate its inhibitor."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高い信号は阻害剤を活性化させるべきです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High-volume exact repetition plus an audit trail favors reproducible code or a spreadsheet with preserved formulas and spot-checks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "High-volume exact repetition plus an audit trail favors reproducible code or a spreadsheet with preserved formulas and spot-checks."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大量の正確な反復処理と監査証跡が必要な場合は、入力を保存した再現可能なコード、または数式を保存したスプレッドシートが適しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight every sentence once": {
