            "state": "translated",
            "value": "索引"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Index 0 exists only when count≥1. The function contract currently permits an input for which its first operation is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Index 0 exists only when count≥1. The function contract currently permits an input for which its first operation is invalid."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インデックス0はcount≥1の場合のみ存在します。関数契約は現在、その最初の操作が無効な入力を許可しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Index status": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Index status"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インデックス状態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Individuals with one genotype leave twice as many offspring as the others.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Individuals with one genotype leave twice as many offspring as the others."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一つの遺伝子型の個人は他の遺伝子型の個人よりも二倍の数の子孫を残します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Induction requires both a base proposition and a step from each established case. The step alone proves only a conditional, not any actual instance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Induction requires both a base proposition and a step from each established case. The step alone proves only a conditional, not any actual instance."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誘導には、基本的な命題と確立された各ケースからのステップの両方が必要です。 ステップだけが、実際のインスタンスではなく、条件付けられたインスタンスのみを証明します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Infer rate-law structure from controlled comparisons and distinguish fit from mechanism.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "制御された比較から速度式の構造を推定し、当てはまりと機構を区別します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Infer the planar shape produced when a named solid is sliced by a stated plane.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Infer the planar shape produced when a named solid is sliced by a stated plane."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定された立体を指定された平面で切ったときにできる断面の形を推定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inheritance probabilities follow from the stated parental genotypes, segregation model, and linkage assumptions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Inheritance probabilities follow from the stated parental genotypes, segregation model, and linkage assumptions."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遺伝子の確率は、述べる親の遺伝子型、分離モデル、および連結仮定から導出されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initial kinetic energy is ½×3×2²=6 J. Applied work is 9×4=36 J and friction contributes −6 J, so final kinetic energy is 36 J. Solving ½×3×v²=36 gives v=√24≈4.899 m/s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initial kinetic energy is ½×3×2²=6 J. Applied work is 9×4=36 J and friction contributes −6 J, so final kinetic energy is 36 J. Solving ½×3×v²=36 gives v=√24≈4.899 m/s."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初期動能は½×3×2²=6 Jです。応力仕事は9×4=36 Jで、摩擦は-6 Jに寄与するため、最終動能は36 Jです。½×3×v²=36を解くと、v=√24≈4.899 m/sが得られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initial momentum is 2×6+1×0=12 kg·m/s. After sticking, total mass is 3 kg, so v=12/3=4 m/s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initial momentum is 2×6+1×0=12 kg·m/s. After sticking, total mass is 3 kg, so v=12/3=4 m/s."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初期運動量は2×6+1×0=12 kg·m/s。粘着後、総質量は3 kgなので、v=12/3=4 m/s。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initial state: count = %lld, ready = false. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初期状態：count = %1$lld、ready = false。 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initial-rate data at fixed temperature fit rate=k[A]². State the empirical order in A and whether that exponent alone proves a single elementary collision of two A molecules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initial-rate data at fixed temperature fit rate=k[A]². State the empirical order in A and whether that exponent alone proves a single elementary collision of two A molecules."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一定温度での初期率データフィット率=k[A]²。Aの経験法則的な順序を述べてください。また、その指数だけが2つのA分子の単一の初級衝突を証明するかどうかを述べてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initial-rate trials differ in both [A] and temperature. Can their rate ratio identify reaction order in A?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initial-rate trials differ in both [A] and temperature. Can their rate ratio identify reaction order in A?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初期レート試験は[A]と温度の両方で異なります。レート比はAの反応順序を特定できますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initialize high to values.count − 1, or use a half-open loop; values.count is not a valid array index.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "high を values.count − 1 に初期化するか、半開区間のループを使ってください。values.count は有効な配列添字ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
