            "value": "無効な番号です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid-step localization": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無効なステップのローカリゼーション"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invertibility provides a two-sided inverse. Applying the inverse preserves equality and reduces A⁻¹A to the identity matrix.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可逆性により両側逆行列が存在します。逆行列を適用しても等式は保たれ、A⁻¹A は単位行列になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invertibility supplies an inverse that preserves equality and reduces A⁻¹A to the identity, ruling out every nonzero null vector.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invertibility supplies an inverse that preserves equality and reduces A⁻¹A to the identity, ruling out every nonzero null vector."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反比例性には、等性を保ち、A⁻¹Aを恒等に還元する反比例性があり、ゼロ以外のすべてのベクトルを除外します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate acceleration before substituting values.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "値を代入する前に加速度を分離します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate the unknown by reversing the stated operation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示された演算の逆演算を使って、未知数だけの形にします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It decreases.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It decreases."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "減少します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It excludes 0; the matching two-sided procedure rejects the zero-difference null at the 5% level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It excludes 0; the matching two-sided procedure rejects the zero-difference null at the 5% level."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0を除外します。一致する両側手順は、5%レベルのゼロ差ヌルを拒否します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It lowers the activation energy": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "活性化エネルギーを低下させます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It must preserve the qualifier ‘may’ and the scope ‘in this sample’; omitting either would strengthen the source beyond what it states.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It must preserve the qualifier ‘may’ and the scope ‘in this sample’; omitting either would strengthen the source beyond what it states."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「このサンプルでは、限定条件である「許可」と範囲を保持しなければなりません。どちらか一方を省略すると、ソースが記載されている範囲を超えて強化されます。」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will return on %@. Today’s progress, active-day count, and consistency history are unchanged.": {
      "comment": "Confirmation after deferring a reassessment; the placeholder is a locale-formatted date.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ に返されます。今日の進捗状況、アクティブな日数、一貫性の履歴は変わりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アイテム"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item allowed again": {
      "comment": "Confirmation after removing a reported item from local quarantine.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アイテムが再び許可されました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item seed, mechanic, response, deterministic credit, error code, revisions, and transfer form are stored for inspection.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アイテムのシード、機構、応答、決定論的クレジット、エラー コード、リビジョン、および転移フォームが検査のために保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Iterate i from 2 through n.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "i を 2 から n まで昇順に反復してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "J=0.80−0.20=0.60.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J=0.80−0.20=0.60."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J=0.80−0.20=0.60。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JavaScript-like": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JavaScript風"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join on a stable unique user ID or deduplicate with an explicit rule; email can duplicate rows in a many-to-many join.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Join on a stable unique user ID or deduplicate with an explicit rule; email can duplicate rows in a many-to-many join."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一元的な固有のユーザー ID で参加するか、明示的なルールで重複を減らします。電子メールは、多対多の結合で行を重複させることができます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Judge only whether your recall is supported by this excerpt.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この抜粋によってあなたの想起が裏付けられるかどうかのみを判断してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Judge what an experiment or observational comparison actually supports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実験や観察比較が実際に何を支持するか判断します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just now": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Just now"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "たった今"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Justify transferring a %@ method to a new setting by stating the structural mapping and the assumptions that must remain true.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Justify transferring a %@ method to a new setting by stating the structural mapping and the assumptions that must remain true."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "構造上の対応関係と、引き続き成り立つべき仮定を示し、%@の方法を新しい状況へ応用できることを正当化してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "K is unchanged and no shift occurs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K is unchanged and no shift occurs."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kは変更されず、シフトは発生しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep all files in this package together. They can contain private training responses and source text; share them only with a destination you trust.": {
      "comment": "Privacy warning in the exported database recovery read-me.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このパッケージ内のファイルはすべてまとめて保管してください。非公開のトレーニング回答や原文が含まれる場合があるため、信頼できる宛先とのみ共有してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep an empty root": {
