            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注釈は%lld文字以内にしてください。保存も短縮も行われていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the arithmetic contrast separate from the study-design claim.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the arithmetic contrast separate from the study-design claim."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "算術の対照を研究設計の主張から分離してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the estimate, plausibility judgment, and exact result separate; use the estimate to audit the exact magnitude.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推定、妥当性の判断、および正確な結果を分離してください。推定値を使用して正確な大きさを監査します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the full STEM toolkit in rotation. Your goals add emphasis without removing broad practice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the full STEM toolkit in rotation. Your goals add emphasis without removing broad practice."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "STEMツールキット全体を繰り返し鍛えます。目標に応じて重点を加えても、幅広い練習は残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the interval attached to the estimated quantity and its assumptions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推定数量とその仮定に付随する間隔を維持します。"
