    "Left derivative −1 and right derivative 1; therefore |x| is not differentiable at 0.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Left derivative −1 and right derivative 1; therefore |x| is not differentiable at 0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左導関数−1と右導関数1。したがって、|x|は0で微分可能ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left-multiply Ax=0 by A⁻¹: A⁻¹Ax=A⁻¹0, so Ix=0 and x=0. Hence null(A)={0}.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Left-multiply Ax=0 by A⁻¹: A⁻¹Ax=A⁻¹0, so Ix=0 and x=0. Hence null(A)={0}."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左乗Ax=0をA⁻¹で乗じる：A⁻¹Ax=A⁻¹⁰、したがってIx=0とx=0。したがって、null(A)={0}。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left-multiply both sides by A⁻¹.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両辺の左から A⁻¹ を掛けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left-multiply by A⁻¹ to get x = 0, so null(A) = {0}.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左から A⁻¹ を掛けて x = 0 を得るので、null(A) = {0} です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Less-than-or-equal admits index equal to count, which is outside the array.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「以下」では、配列の外にあるインデックスとカウントが一致することが認められます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let A be an invertible square matrix. Prove that the only solution of": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let A be an invertible square matrix. Prove that the only solution of"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aを可逆な正方行列とします。次の方程式の解が一意であることを証明してください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let A be an invertible square matrix. Prove that the only solution of\n\n$$Ax=0$$\n\nis x = 0, and identify the resulting statement about the null space of A.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A を可逆な正方行列とします。\n\n$$Ax=0$$\n\nの解が x = 0 のみであることを証明し、A の零空間について得られる結論を述べてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let A be an invertible square matrix. Prove that the only solution of $$Ax=0$$ is x=0, and state the resulting null space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let A be an invertible square matrix. Prove that the only solution of $$Ax=0$$ is x=0, and state the resulting null space."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aは可逆平方行列であるとします。$$Ax=0$$の唯一の解はx=0であることを証明し、結果として生じる空スペースを述べてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let P mean that the %@ input passed validation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pは、%1$@の入力が検証に合格したことを意味するとします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let P mean: “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pは「%1$@」を意味するとします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the numbers choose the method": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字に方法を選ばせよう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let u be the non-stale minimum-key unfinalized vertex. If a shorter source-to-u path existed, its first edge leaving the finalized set would reach a frontier vertex with a key smaller than distance[u], because all remaining edge weights are nonnegative. That contradicts u being the minimum, so distance[u] is final.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "u を古くない最小キーを持つ未確定頂点とします。始点から u へのより短い経路があるなら、確定済み集合から出る最初の辺は、残る辺がすべて非負なので distance[u] より小さいキーを持つ境界頂点に到達します。これは u が最小であることに矛盾するため、distance[u] は最終値です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let x and t be measured in seconds, and let the flow rate be $$r(t)=(1 \\mathrm{L}/\\mathrm{s}^3)t^2.$$ Define $$A(x)=\\int_0^x r(t)\\,dt.$$ Use the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus to derive A′(x), then compute A′(2) and distinguish its units from the accumulated total A(2).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let x and t be measured in seconds, and let the flow rate be $$r(t)=(1 \\mathrm{L}/\\mathrm{s}^3)t^2.$$ Define $$A(x)=\\int_0^x r(t)\\,dt.$$ Use the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus to derive A′(x), then compute A′(2) and distinguish its units from the accumulated total A(2)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "xとtを秒で測定し、流量$$r(t)=(1 \\mathrm{L}/\\mathrm{s}^3)t^2.$$ $$A(x)=\\int_0^x r(t)\\,dt.$$を定義します。微積分基礎定理を使用してA′(x)を導き出し、次にA′(2)を計算し、その単位を累積した合計A(2)と区別します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let x and y be the nonnegative integer counts of standard and protein trays. Maximize 30x+50y subject to x+2y≤8, 2x+3y≤18, and x,y∈{0,1,2,…}.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let x and y be the nonnegative integer counts of standard and protein trays. Maximize 30x+50y subject to x+2y≤8, 2x+3y≤18, and x,y∈{0,1,2,…}."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "標準トレイとタンパク質トレイの負の整数カウントにxとyとします。x+2y≤8、2x+3y≤18、x、y∈{0、1、2、}に制約され、30x+50yを最大化します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let z be the free variable and solve upward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
