    "New daily sessions follow your usual pacing and timing preferences. Timed fluency still requires suitable practice evidence; saved questions keep their original settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New daily sessions follow your usual pacing and timing preferences. Timed fluency still requires suitable practice evidence; saved questions keep their original settings."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しく始めるデイリーセッションは、通常のペースと時間設定に従います。時間制の習熟練習には、適切な練習記録が引き続き必要です。保存済みの問題は元の設定を保ちます。"
