      }
    },
    "No, the converse does not follow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ、逆は導かれません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No. Length and time cannot be added; v=d/t has dimension length/time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. Length and time cannot be added; v=d/t has dimension length/time."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ。長さと時間は追加できません。v=d/tには寸法長さ/時間があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No. Outcome-related differential attrition can break the comparability created by randomization. Track outcomes aggressively, report attrition by arm and reason, and use a prespecified intention-to-treat analysis with defensible missing-data sensitivity bounds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. Outcome-related differential attrition can break the comparability created by randomization. Track outcomes aggressively, report attrition by arm and reason, and use a prespecified intention-to-treat analysis with defensible missing-data sensitivity bounds."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ。結果関連の差異消耗は、ランダム化によって作成された比較可能性を破ることができます。結果を積極的に追跡し、腕と理由で消耗を報告し、防御可能な欠損データ感度境界を持つ事前に指定された治療意向分析を使用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No. The stress amplitudes differ, so compare specimens at the same stress or compare controlled S–N curves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. The stress amplitudes differ, so compare specimens at the same stress or compare controlled S–N curves."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ。応力振幅は異なりますので、同じ応力で試料を比較するか、制御されたS-N曲線を比較してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No. Voluntary recruitment from a disease-support forum creates selection bias; sample from a defined population frame with probability-based recruitment or calibrated weighting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. Voluntary recruitment from a disease-support forum creates selection bias; sample from a defined population frame with probability-based recruitment or calibrated weighting."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ。疾患支援フォーラムからの自主募集は、選択バイアスを生み出します。確率ベースの募集またはキャライザーリングウェイトを持つ定義された集団フレームからのサンプル。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No; publishable does not imply verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ。公開可能であることから、検証済みとは導けません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No; temperature is a confounder, so compare trials where temperature and other reactants are fixed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No; temperature is a confounder, so compare trials where temperature and other reactants are fixed."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ、温度は混乱の原因なので、温度と他のリアクターが固定されている試験を比較してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
