    "Number sense, quantitative thinking, spatial reasoning, scientific evidence, logic and debugging, and research recall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Number sense, quantitative thinking, spatial reasoning, scientific evidence, logic and debugging, and research recall."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数感覚、量的思考、空間推論、科学的根拠、論理とデバッグ、研究資料の想起を鍛えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Numbers found elsewhere in a document are not automatically comparable. Labels and the paper’s defined contrast are necessary to avoid inventing a calculation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Numbers found elsewhere in a document are not automatically comparable. Labels and the paper’s defined contrast are necessary to avoid inventing a calculation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文書の他の場所で見つかった数字は、自動的に比較できません。計算を発明しないように、ラベルと紙の定義されたコントラストが必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Numbers that refer to different quantities cannot be turned into a change score merely because they appear in sequence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "異なる量を表す数値は、順に並んでいるだけで変化量に変換することはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Numbers, comparison direction, modality, and population scope can change a claim’s meaning, so each must survive recall when present.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Numbers, comparison direction, modality, and population scope can change a claim’s meaning, so each must survive recall when present."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数値、比較の向き、確実性を示す表現、対象集団の範囲は主張の意味を変え得るため、含まれている場合はすべて想起に残す必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
