          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nₜ₊₁=125. The increment is 0.50×100×(1−100/200)=25; as N approaches carrying capacity 200, the factor (1−N/200) approaches zero, so growth slows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nₜ₊₁=125. The increment is 0.50×100×(1−100/200)=25; as N approaches carrying capacity 200, the factor (1−N/200) approaches zero, so growth slows."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nₜ₊₁=125。増分は0.50×100×(1−100/200)=25です。Nがキャパシティ200に近づくと、係数(1−N/200)がゼロに近づき、成長が鈍化します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nₜ₊₁=216. The increment is 0.50×240×(1−240/200)=−24, so abundance declines toward the carrying capacity rather than growing without bound.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nₜ₊₁=216. The increment is 0.50×240×(1−240/200)=−24, so abundance declines toward the carrying capacity rather than growing without bound."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nₜ₊₁=216。増分は0.50×240×(1−240/200)=−24なので、豊かさは無制限で成長するのではなく、キャリングカプシティに向かって減少します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "N≈40×50/10=200 animals.": {
