    "Population, participation fraction, and use per participant are distinct factors. Writing them separately makes double-counting visible and makes sensitivity proportional to each factor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Population, participation fraction, and use per participant are distinct factors. Writing them separately makes double-counting visible and makes sensitivity proportional to each factor."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人口、参加割合、参加者あたりの使用量は異なる要因です。それらを別々に書くと、二重算が明らかになり、感度は各要因に比例します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Position %lld of %lld": {
