          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Positive, negative, and procedural controls answer different failure questions and should be chosen explicitly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Positive, negative, and procedural controls answer different failure questions and should be chosen explicitly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "陽性対照、陰性対照、手順対照はそれぞれ異なる不具合の問いに答えるため、目的を明示して選ぶ必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Potential saturation directly threatens the linear-model assumption.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "潜在的な飽和は、線形モデルの仮定を直接脅かします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power is P=VI=9×2=18 W, then energy is E=Pt=18×30=540 J. Watts times seconds reduce to joules.": {
