    },
    "Practice, alternate-form transfer, delayed retention, confidence, interruptions, and scoring-rule provenance are retained as separate inspectable channels.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "練習、代替フォームの転移、遅延保持、確信度、中断、および得点ルールの来歴は、個別の検査可能なチャネルとして保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision as a percentage is": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precision as a percentage is"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適合率を百分率で表すと"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision as a percentage is\n\n$$100 \\times \\frac{TP}{TP + FP}$$": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適合率を百分率で表すと、次のとおりです\n\n$$100 \\times \\frac{TP}{TP + FP}$$"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision concerns repeatability, not just mean accuracy. Both center near 10.00, but the first cluster spans only 0.02 versus 1.00.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precision concerns repeatability, not just mean accuracy. Both center near 10.00, but the first cluster spans only 0.02 versus 1.00."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精密度の問題は、精度だけでなく再現性に関係しています。中心値は10.00に近いだけでなく、最初のクラスタは0.02対1.00にすぎません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision is 0.80 and recall is 0.50. Compute F1=2PR/(P+R).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precision is 0.80 and recall is 0.50. Compute F1=2PR/(P+R)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精度は0.80、リコールは0.50です。F1=2PR/(P+R)を計算します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision records repeatability; it does not guarantee accuracy relative to the true value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Precision records repeatability; it does not guarantee accuracy relative to the true value."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精密さは再現性を表しますが、真値に対する正確さを保証しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision uses predicted positives in its denominator, whereas recall uses actual positives.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Precision uses predicted positives in its denominator, whereas recall uses actual positives."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適合率は予測陽性を分母にし、再現率は実際の陽性を分母にします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision=TP/(TP+FP)=40/50=0.80.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precision=TP/(TP+FP)=40/50=0.80."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精度=TP/(TP+FP)=40/50=0.80。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Predeclare the metric and summarize repeated seeds or resamples with uncertainty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Predeclare the metric and summarize repeated seeds or resamples with uncertainty."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "評価指標を事前に定め、複数の乱数シードや再標本化の結果を不確実性とともに要約します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Predeclare the primary outcome and account for the planned family of comparisons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
