    "Prove Dijkstra’s finalization step. Assume every edge weight is nonnegative and u is removed from the priority queue with its current minimum tentative distance. Show that no shorter source-to-u path can exist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダイクストラ法の確定ステップを証明してください。すべての辺の重みは非負で、u は現在の最小暫定距離を持つエントリとして優先度付きキューから取り出されたとします。始点から u へのより短い経路が存在しないことを示してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prove by contradiction that $$\\sqrt{2}$$ is irrational. Begin with √2=a/b in lowest terms and make the parity contradiction explicit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prove by contradiction that $$\\sqrt{2}$$ is irrational. Begin with √2=a/b in lowest terms and make the parity contradiction explicit."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "矛盾によって$$\\sqrt{2}$$が不合理であることを証明します。最低項目の√2=a/bから始め、偶数性矛盾を明示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prove by induction that $$1+2+\\cdots+n=\\frac{n(n+1)}2$$ for every integer n≥1. Show the base case, induction hypothesis, and k→k+1 algebra.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prove by induction that $$1+2+\\cdots+n=\\frac{n(n+1)}2$$ for every integer n≥1. Show the base case, induction hypothesis, and k→k+1 algebra."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整数n≥1に対して$$1+2+\\cdots+n=\\frac{n(n+1)}2$$であることを帰納法で証明します。基本状態、帰納仮説、k→k+1代律を示してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prove by mathematical induction that": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prove by mathematical induction that"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数学的帰納法で次を証明してください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prove by mathematical induction that\n\n$$1 + 2 + \\cdots + n = \\frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$$\n\nfor every integer n ≥ 1. State the base case, induction hypothesis, and algebraic step for k + 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての整数 n ≥ 1 について、\n\n$$1 + 2 + \\cdots + n = \\frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$$\n\nを数学的帰納法で証明してください。基底事例、帰納法の仮定、k + 1 に対する代数的な段階を示してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prove that n² and n have the same parity for every integer n by considering the two cases n=2k and n=2k+1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prove that n² and n have the same parity for every integer n by considering the two cases n=2k and n=2k+1."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "n=2kとn=2k+1という2つの場合を考慮して、n²とnがすべての整数nに対して同じパリティを持っていることを証明します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prove the statement for k + 1 without using the induction hypothesis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帰納法の仮定を使わずに、k + 1 について命題を証明する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Provide the labeled values, units, comparison groups, and effect definition from the source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provide the labeled values, units, comparison groups, and effect definition from the source."
