          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reports never leave the device automatically. Allowing retry changes scheduling only; it does not erase the diagnostic record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レポートが自動的にデバイスから送信されることはありません。再試行の変更を許可するのはスケジュールのみです。診断記録は消去されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reports remain on this device until you delete them and are included in the full JSON export. Allowing a question again preserves its original report for your history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
