    },
    "Reversal, qualifier deletion, causal upgrade, and universalization are distinct meaning changes that the reference avoids.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reversal, qualifier deletion, causal upgrade, and universalization are distinct meaning changes that the reference avoids."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "関係の逆転、限定表現の削除、因果主張への強化、普遍化はいずれも意味を変える別々の誤りであり、参照回答はそれらを避けています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reversing Q/K or including pure solids can predict the wrong shift.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
