            "value": "選択したファイル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected files are copied into app-managed storage and are never executed. OCR runs on the device when you request it for a scanned PDF. The Question Writer Shortcut receives only bounded excerpts from sources you approve for that run, never the original file. A document original syncs to iCloud only when you enable sync for that document. Spotlight indexing is optional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selected files are copied into app-managed storage and are never executed. OCR runs on the device when you request it for a scanned PDF. The Question Writer Shortcut receives only bounded excerpts from sources you approve for that run, never the original file. A document original syncs to iCloud only when you enable sync for that document. Spotlight indexing is optional."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択したファイルはアプリ管理のストレージにコピーされ、実行されることはありません。スキャンPDFで指定した場合、OCRはデバイス上で実行されます。問題作成ショートカットが受け取るのは、その実行で承認したソースからの範囲制限された抜粋だけで、元ファイルは受け取りません。文書の原本は、その文書の同期を有効にした場合にのみiCloudへ同期されます。Spotlightの索引作成は任意です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected material stays on this device and creates cited questions offline. To use approved excerpts with Question Writer, choose Question Writer + offline for each source in Library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selected material stays on this device and creates cited questions offline. To use approved excerpts with Question Writer, choose Question Writer + offline for each source in Library."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した資料はこのデバイスに残り、引用付きの問題をオフラインで作成します。問題作成で承認した抜粋を使用するには、ライブラリで各ソースを「問題作成 + オフライン」に設定してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected material stays on this device and creates cited questions offline. To use approved excerpts with Question Writer, choose Question Writer + offline for each source in Sources.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selected material stays on this device and creates cited questions offline. To use approved excerpts with Question Writer, choose Question Writer + offline for each source in Sources."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した資料はこのデバイスに保存され、出典付きの問題をオフラインで作成します。承認した抜粋をQuestion Writerで使用するには、ソース画面で各資料を「Question Writer＋オフライン」に設定してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected skill weights, transfer dimensions, mission family, seed, result, and evidence class remain available for audit.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択したスキルの重み、転移ディメンション、ミッション ファミリ、シード、結果、証拠クラスは引き続き監査に利用できます。"
