            "state": "translated",
            "value": "効果の大きさの価値からゼロに対する別々の証拠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate evidence for the observed pattern from evidence about whether causation was tested.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "観察されたパターンの証拠と、因果関係が検証されたかどうかに関する証拠を分離します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate features that remain fixed from features changed by the operation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定されたままの機能と操作によって変更された機能を分離します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate flaws from strengths": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欠点と長所を区別する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate forecasting Y from estimating Y under do(X=x).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Separate forecasting Y from estimating Y under do(X=x)."
