          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Solute conservation gives C₁V₁=C₂V₂, so V₂=C₁V₁/C₂=(2.0 M)(50 mL)/(0.50 M)=200 mL. The student inverted C₁/C₂; a dilution to lower concentration must increase, not decrease, the final volume.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solute conservation gives C₁V₁=C₂V₂, so V₂=C₁V₁/C₂=(2.0 M)(50 mL)/(0.50 M)=200 mL. The student inverted C₁/C₂; a dilution to lower concentration must increase, not decrease, the final volume."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "溶質の保存はC₁V₁=C₂V₂を与えるので、V₂=C₁V₁/C₂=(2.0 M)(50 mL)/(0.50 M)=200 mL。学生はC₁/C₂を反転させました。より低い濃度への希釈は、最終体積を減らすのではなく、増加しなければなりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
