    "Specimen A survives 10⁶ cycles at 180 MPa; specimen B survives 10⁵ cycles at 220 MPa. Can these two observations alone establish that A has better fatigue resistance?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Specimen A survives 10⁶ cycles at 180 MPa; specimen B survives 10⁵ cycles at 220 MPa. Can these two observations alone establish that A has better fatigue resistance?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "試験片Aは180MPaで10⁶サイクル生き残ります。試験片Bは220MPaで10⁵サイクル生き残ります。この2つの観察だけで、Aの方が疲労抵抗性が高いと判断できますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
