        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スピード重視"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speed unavailable · untimed": {
      "comment": "Status title when the user chose untimed work and no speed estimate is shown.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "速度を利用できません · 時間制限なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speed uses correct, uninterrupted Rapid Recall work. Skips and hints do not raise these results.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "速度には、正解した中断のないRapid Recallの取り組みだけを使います。スキップやヒントでこの結果が上がることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split by patient ID, not by event row, so one person cannot appear in both train and test.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split by patient ID, not by event row, so one person cannot appear in both train and test."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "イベント行ではなく、患者IDで分割されるため、1人ずつがトレインとテストの両方に表示されることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split by the intended generalization unit, such as person, site, or future time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Split by the intended generalization unit, such as person, site, or future time."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人、場所、未来の時間など、意図した一般化単位で分割します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split first and fit every learned transform on training data only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Split first and fit every learned transform on training data only."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最初に分割し、学習した変換をトレーニングデータのみに合わせます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split first, fit the encoder vocabulary on training data, then transform test data with an unknown-category policy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split first, fit the encoder vocabulary on training data, then transform test data with an unknown-category policy."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最初に分割し、トレーニングデータにエンコーダの語彙を当てはめ、未知のカテゴリポリシーでテストデータを変換します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split first, fit the scaler on training rows only, and transform test rows with those training parameters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split first, fit the scaler on training rows only, and transform test rows with those training parameters."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最初に分割し、スケラをトレーニング行にのみ配置し、トレーニングパラメータでテスト行を変換します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split first, then fit the scaler on training data only; fitting before the split leaks test-set information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先に分割し、その後スケーラーを訓練データだけに適合させます。分割前に適合させると、テストセットの情報が漏洩します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split one factor if needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必要に応じて 1 つの要素を分割する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split the population by disease status before applying test rates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split the population by disease status before applying test rates."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "検査率を適用する前に、疾病状況で人口を分割します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split the quotient with f(x+h)g(x), then take limits to obtain (fg)'=f g'+g f'.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
