    "Starting from rest, an object accelerates uniformly at 2 m/s² for 6 s. First check that v=v₀+at returns zero when t=0, then find the final speed in m/s. Return only the final number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting from rest, an object accelerates uniformly at 2 m/s² for 6 s. First check that v=v₀+at returns zero when t=0, then find the final speed in m/s. Return only the final number."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静止点から始め、物体は2 m/s²で6秒間均一に加速します。まず、t=0のときにv=v₀+atがゼロに戻るかどうかを確認し、次にm/sの最終速度を求めます。最終的な数字のみを返します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting from the difference quotient, derive the product rule for differentiable functions f and g by adding and subtracting $$f(x+h)g(x).$$": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting from the difference quotient, derive the product rule for differentiable functions f and g by adding and subtracting $$f(x+h)g(x).$$"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "差商から、可微分関数の倍率法則 f と g を $$f(x+h)g(x) を足し引いて導出します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting level": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
