    "Subtract the right-hand side from both sides to obtain %@; applying the same operation to both sides preserves equality.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "式の両辺から右辺を引くと%@が得られます。同じ演算を両辺に適用するため、等式は保たれます。"
