      }
    },
    "Subtracting the same expression from both sides preserves the solution set and yields\n\n$$%@$$": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両辺から同じ式を引いても解集合は変わらず、次の式が得られます\n\n$$%@$$"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success on one unfamiliar item is narrow evidence. Broad claims require repeated independent transfer and delayed retention.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 つの馴染みのない項目で成功したということは、狭い証拠です。広範な請求には、独立した転移を繰り返し、保持を遅らせる必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Successful transfer is shown by solving a novel case and checking the result against the target constraints.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Successful transfer is shown by solving a novel case and checking the result against the target constraints."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しいケースを解決し、結果を対象制約に対して照合することで、転送が成功したことが示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sufficient but not necessary": {
