            "value": "ゼロと最小許容インスタンスのテストエンドポイント。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test implications instead of relying on whether a conclusion sounds plausible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結論のもっともらしさではなく、含意そのものを検証します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test reciprocal crosses or informative recombinants to separate linkage from a simple independent model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Test reciprocal crosses or informative recombinants to separate linkage from a simple independent model."
