          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比例法則はu=4×1.5=6を与えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The proposed relation is tested only near one comfortable operating point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The proposed relation is tested only near one comfortable operating point."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提案された関係性は、快適な動作ポイントの1つ付近でのみテストされます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question asks for the %@; the selected statement answers that role directly while the other statements address different checks in the same topic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The question asks for the %@; the selected statement answers that role directly while the other statements address different checks in the same topic."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問題は%@を尋ねています。選択した文はその役割に直接答え、ほかの文は同じトピック内の別の確認事項を扱っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question asks for the smallest nonempty failing input.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この質問では、空ではない失敗した最小の入力が求められます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question request could not be saved on this device.": {
