            "state": "translated",
            "value": "質問セットを削除できませんでした。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The questions are still available, but their AI provenance could not be saved.": {
      "comment": "Non-destructive AI-generation provenance persistence error.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "質問はまだ利用可能ですが、AIの出所を保存できませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rate is %lld %@ per minute for %lld minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The rate is %1$lld %2$@ per minute for %3$lld minutes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レートは、%3$lld 分間、1 分あたり %1$lld %2$@ です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ratio is inverted: V₂=C₁V₁/C₂=200 mL, not 12.5 mL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ratio is inverted: V₂=C₁V₁/C₂=200 mL, not 12.5 mL."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比率は逆さです：V₂=C₁V₁/C₂=200 mL、12.5 mLではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ratio is not just arithmetic: the 0≤η≤1 boundary check follows because useful work cannot exceed the supplied energy in this model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ratio is not just arithmetic: the 0≤η≤1 boundary check follows because useful work cannot exceed the supplied energy in this model."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比率は算式にすぎず、0≤η≤1の境界チェックは、このモデルで有用な作業が供給されたエネルギーを超えられないため、従います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ratio y divided by x remains %lld in every row, so the invariant relationship is y equals %lld times x.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The ratio y divided by x remains %1$lld in every row, so the invariant relationship is y equals %2$lld times x."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "y を x で割った比率はどの行でも %1$lld のままであるため、不変関係は y が %2$lld x x に等しいということになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reaction extent is min(nA/2, nB), so product C is 2 × min(nA/2, nB) = %lld mol.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反応進行度はmin(nA/2, nB)なので、生成物Cは2 × min(nA/2, nB) = %lld molです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reaction quotient Q has the same form as K and predicts direction by comparison with K.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The reaction quotient Q has the same form as K and predicts direction by comparison with K."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反応商 Q は平衡定数 K と同じ形を持ち、K との比較から反応の進む向きを予測します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reassessment schedule could not be saved. Training remains available.": {
      "comment": "Non-blocking reassessment-schedule persistence error.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再評価スケジュールを保存できませんでした。トレーニングは引き続き利用可能です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recessive allele is lethal": {
