          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recessive allele is lethal"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レシナントアレルは致命的です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The record was definitely verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その記録は確実に検証済みだった"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recursion tree doubles at each level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recursion tree doubles at each level."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再帰ツリーは各レベルで倍増します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reference answer is copied from the cited excerpt. NeuroForge does not independently verify that the source itself is true.": {
      "comment": "Disclosure explaining the limits of an exact cited-source restatement.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参照回答は引用された抜粋からそのまま取得しています。NeuroForgeは資料そのものの真偽を独立検証しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reference answer is the excerpt’s first complete claim, retained without adding certainty or causal force.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参照解答は、抜粋の最初の完全な主張を、確実性や因果的な強さを加えずに保ったものです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reference retains the source proposition and all words that limit certainty, conditions, or scope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The reference retains the source proposition and all words that limit certainty, conditions, or scope."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参照回答は、出典の命題と、確実性・条件・適用範囲を限定するすべての表現を保っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reference was not yet retrievable; review it briefly and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
