          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The response preserves the central supported relationship.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "応答では、中心的なサポートされる関係が維持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The response remains on screen so you can retry.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "応答は画面に残るので、再試行できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The restore could not be verified. Keep the original backup and review your saved records before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The restore could not be verified. Keep the original backup and review your saved records before trying again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "復元の検証ができませんでした。元のバックアップを保管し、保存済みの記録を確認してから再試行してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result does not match part divided by whole times 100.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結果は、部分を整数倍 100 で割った値と一致しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result proves group A will always do better.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The result proves group A will always do better."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この結果は、Aグループが常に良い成績を収めることを証明している。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The resultant magnitude is the area under the uniform load diagram: 4×5=20 kN, applied at the rectangle’s centroid at midspan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The resultant magnitude is the area under the uniform load diagram: 4×5=20 kN, applied at the rectangle’s centroid at midspan."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結果として得られる振る幅は、均一荷重図の下の面積です：4×5=20kN、中スパンの長方形の中央値に適用されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The returned questions did not pass NeuroForge checks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The returned questions did not pass NeuroForge checks."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返された質問は、NeuroForgeのチェックに合格しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The returned questions did not pass NeuroForge checks. Offline question writing remains available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The returned questions did not pass NeuroForge checks. Offline question writing remains available."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返された質問はNeuroForgeのチェックに合格しませんでした。オフライン質問の作成は引き続き可能です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The returned questions did not pass NeuroForge checks. The set was created offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The returned questions did not pass NeuroForge checks. The set was created offline."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返された質問はNeuroForgeのチェックに合格しませんでした。セットはオフラインで作成されました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reverse relationship always holds without additional conditions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逆の関係は追加の条件なしで常に成り立ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The review preference could not be saved. Your schedule is unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The review preference could not be saved. Your schedule is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "復習設定を保存できませんでした。予定は変更されていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right-hand side names the values consumed by the assignment. Evaluating the target before those inputs are defined would use missing or stale state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The right-hand side names the values consumed by the assignment. Evaluating the target before those inputs are defined would use missing or stale state."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右辺には代入で使われる値が記されています。それらの入力が定義される前に代入先を評価すると、未定義または古い状態が使われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The root of a max-heap must be the largest remaining key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The root of a max-heap must be the largest remaining key."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最大ハッブのルートは、残りの最大のキーでなければなりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule (x,y)→(−x,y) fixes points on the y-axis and moves B across it. A reflection is a rigid but orientation-reversing transformation, so it preserves the triangle’s metric and adjacency structure.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rule (x,y)→(−x,y) fixes points on the y-axis and moves B across it. A reflection is a rigid but orientation-reversing transformation, so it preserves the triangle’s metric and adjacency structure."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定数（x、y）→（-x、y）は、y軸上の点を固定し、Bをその軸に移動させます。反射は剛体ですが、方向転換を反転させる変換なので、三角形のメトリックと隣接構造を保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule gives verified → publishable. Inferring verified from published reverses the implication.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則が示すのは「検証済み → 公開可能」です。公開されたことから検証済みと推論すると、含意の向きを逆にしてしまいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule is false": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その規則は誤りである"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The safe deterministic task counts the %lld explicit numeric values instead of inventing a subtraction or ratio between unrelated quantities.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全な決定論的タスクでは、無関係な量同士の差や比を作り出さず、明示された%lld個の数値を数えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same 30 patients are measured before and after treatment, but an analyst applies an independent-groups test to the 60 measurements. Which assumption is violated, and what analysis matches the design?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same 30 patients are measured before and after treatment, but an analyst applies an independent-groups test to the 60 measurements. Which assumption is violated, and what analysis matches the design?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ30人の患者を治療の前後に測定しますが、アナリストは60回の測定に独立したグループテストを適用します。どの仮定が違反され、どの分析が設計に一致しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same endpoints require the same ΔU=320 J even though heat and work are path quantities. From ΔU=Q−W_by, W_by=650−320=330 J.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same endpoints require the same ΔU=320 J even though heat and work are path quantities. From ΔU=Q−W_by, W_by=650−320=330 J."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "熱量と仕事量がパス量であるにもかかわらず、同じエンドポイントは同じΔU=320 Jを必要とします。 ΔU=Q−W_byから、W_by=650−320=330 J。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same opaque request ID supplied to the first NeuroForge action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The same opaque request ID supplied to the first NeuroForge action."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最初のNeuroForgeアクションに渡したものと同じ不透明なリクエストID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same prompt immediately": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すぐに同じプロンプトが表示される"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same voltage appears across both branches; add their currents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same voltage appears across both branches; add their currents."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両方の分岐に同じ電圧が現れます。それらの電流を加えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sample contains both homozygotes and heterozygotes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sample contains both homozygotes and heterozygotes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このサンプルの両方の子種は単倍体と二倍体が含まれています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sample is large": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サンプルが大きい"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The samples were heated to 80 °C and held there for 10 minutes before measurement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The samples were heated to 80 °C and held there for 10 minutes before measurement."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測定前に、サンプルの温度を80°Cに加熱し、10分間保持しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved cloud request is not bound to a verified device-cleanup intent. Nothing was deleted. Retry staging from the original launch.": {
      "comment": "Complete private-iCloud deletion failure when the matching local purge was not durably staged.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されたクラウドリクエストが、確認済みのデバイスクリーンアップの意図に紐付いていません。何も削除されていません。最初の起動時の準備からやり直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved configuration draft could not be removed. AI Studio remains open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved configuration draft could not be removed. AI Studio remains open."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みの設定下書きを削除できませんでした。AIスタジオは開いたままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved coordinate pair does not match the requested time and proportional distance. Recheck both units and the multiplier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved coordinate pair does not match the requested time and proportional distance. Recheck both units and the multiplier."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存された座標の組は、指定された時間と比例する距離に一致しません。両方の単位と倍率を確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved database could not be opened or migrated with schema %@.": {
      "comment": "Recovery-mode explanation when the saved database cannot be opened or migrated; the placeholder is the required schema version.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みデータベースを開くことも、スキーマ%1$@へ移行することもできませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved database could not be opened, and NeuroForge could not prepare its protected recovery package. Preserve the app container and retry with a migration-capable build.": {
      "comment": "Recovery-mode explanation when the app cannot create a protected database recovery package.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みデータベースを開けず、NeuroForgeは保護された復旧パッケージも準備できませんでした。アプリコンテナを保持し、移行に対応したビルドで再試行してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved database could not be opened, and an older protected recovery package could not be safely rotated. Preserve the app container and retry with a migration-capable build.": {
      "comment": "Recovery-mode explanation when a previous protected database recovery package cannot be safely replaced.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みデータベースを開けず、以前の保護された復旧パッケージも安全に入れ替えられませんでした。アプリコンテナを保持し、移行に対応したビルドで再試行してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved deletion request could not be matched exactly. Nothing was deleted.": {
      "comment": "Complete private-iCloud deletion failure when durable request identity cannot be matched exactly.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存された削除リクエストを正確に照合できませんでした。何も削除されていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved private iCloud deletion could not finish safely. No database will open at this boundary. Retry after iCloud is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されたプライベートiCloud削除を安全に完了できませんでした。この境界ではデータベースを開きません。iCloudが利用可能になってから再試行してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved prompt and your response are shown, but the protected answer key stays hidden so a future skill check remains valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved prompt and your response are shown, but the protected answer key stays hidden so a future skill check remains valid."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存された問題文と回答は表示されますが、今後のスキルチェックを有効に保つため、保護された解答キーは非表示です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved relationship does not preserve the source's accumulation structure, even if the target number is right.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved relationship does not preserve the source's accumulation structure, even if the target number is right."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計量の数値が正しくても、保存した関係は元の課題の累積する構造を保っていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved response cannot be plotted on this grid. Its original coordinate text is retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved response cannot be plotted on this grid. Its original coordinate text is retained."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存された回答はこのグラフに描画できません。元の座標テキストは保持されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved source revision cannot be verified, so the current source is unavailable for this citation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved source revision cannot be verified, so the current source is unavailable for this citation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されたソースの改訂版を確認できないため、この出典では現在のソースを利用できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved step order is unavailable. Your original answer is retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved step order is unavailable. Your original answer is retained."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存された手順の順序を読み込めません。元の回答は保持されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved timing data is unavailable. Your original question and answer are retained for recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved timing data is unavailable. Your original question and answer are retained for recovery."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存された時間データを利用できません。元の問題と回答は復旧用に保持されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scorer knows the condition while judging a subjective phenotype.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The scorer knows the condition while judging a subjective phenotype."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主観的な表現型を判断しながら、スコアラーはその状態を知っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scores have a mean": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スコアには平均値がある"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen coordinate is (2,−1); the projection discards z-depth. Therefore points with the same x and y but different z values overlap in this view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The screen coordinate is (2,−1); the projection discards z-depth. Therefore points with the same x and y but different z values overlap in this view."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面座標は（2,−1）であり、投影はz深さを破棄します。したがって、同じxとyを持つが異なるz値を持つ点は、このビューで重なり合います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secant slope is (9−1)/(3−1)=4. Since f′(x)=2x, 2c=4 gives c=2. Polynomials are continuous on [1,3] and differentiable on (1,3).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The secant slope is (9−1)/(3−1)=4. Since f′(x)=2x, 2c=4 gives c=2. Polynomials are continuous on [1,3] and differentiable on (1,3)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正交勾配は（9−1）/（3−1）=4です。f′（x）=2xなので、2c=4はc=2を与えます。多項式は[1,3]で連続的であり、（1,3）で可微分です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The second row is twice the first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The second row is twice the first."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二列目は一列の倍です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file could not be read.": {
      "comment": "Local study-material import error.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択したファイルを読み取れませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file could not be read. Try another local copy.": {
      "comment": "Privacy-reviewed local file-reading error.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択したファイルを読み取れませんでした。別のローカルコピーを試してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected first score is unusually high; the follow-up is closer to the population mean.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択された最初のスコアは異常に高いです。追跡調査は母平均に近づきます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected result preserves the relevant geometry while applying the stated transformation or viewpoint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択された結果は、指定された変換または視点を適用しながら、関連するジオメトリを保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected set misses a design threat or introduces post-outcome selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択されたセットは設計上の脅威を見逃しているか、結果後の選択を導入しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected strategy exploits the visible factor structure while preserving an exact result with the least unnecessary work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The selected strategy exploits the visible factor structure while preserving an exact result with the least unnecessary work."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選んだ方法は見えている因数の構造を利用し、不要な手順を最小限にしながら正確な結果を保ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The series resistance is 10 Ω, so current is 10/10=1 A. The 7 Ω drop is IR=1×7=7 V; the two drops sum to the source voltage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The series resistance is 10 Ω, so current is 10/10=1 A. The 7 Ω drop is IR=1×7=7 V; the two drops sum to the source voltage."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系列抵抗は10Ωなので、電流は10/10=1Aです。7ΩのドロップはIR=1×7=7Vです。2つのドロップはソース電圧に合計されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server-count assumption must be remapped: a single-cashier result cannot be copied to two parallel servers without a two-server service model and routing rule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server-count assumption must be remapped: a single-cashier result cannot be copied to two parallel servers without a two-server service model and routing rule."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーカウントの仮定は再マッピングする必要があります。シングルレジの結果は、2つのサーバーモデルとルーティングルールのない2つの並列サーバーにコピーすることはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session checkpoint could not be saved. The session remains open so you can retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The session checkpoint could not be saved. The session remains open so you can retry."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "セッションのチェックポイントを保存できませんでした。再試行できるよう、セッションは開いたままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The set metadata or retained question content matched; no attempt row contains this search text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The set metadata or retained question content matched; no attempt row contains this search text."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "セットのメタデータまたは保持された問題コンテンツは一致しましたが、この検索文字列を含む試行行はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The seven-day deferral could not be saved.": {
      "comment": "Reassessment-deferral persistence error.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7日間の延期は保存できませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign gives direction and |r|=0.80 indicates a strong linear pattern. Correlation alone does not eliminate confounding or identify an intervention effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sign gives direction and |r|=0.80 indicates a strong linear pattern. Correlation alone does not eliminate confounding or identify an intervention effect."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この符号は方向を示し、|r|=0.80は強い線形パターンを示しています。相関 aloneは混同を排除したり、介入効果を特定したりしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign of f′ describes local change; it does not by itself determine the function’s absolute value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The sign of f′ describes local change; it does not by itself determine the function’s absolute value."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "f′の符号は局所変化を表します。それ自体で関数の絶対値を決定するものではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed change is %@ − %@ = %@. A two-value contrast has no assignment or counterfactual evidence by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The signed change is %@ − %@ = %@. A two-value contrast has no assignment or counterfactual evidence by itself."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符号付き変化は%@ − %@ = %@です。2つの値の差だけでは、割り当てや反実仮想の証拠にはなりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed change is %@; this two-observation contrast alone does not establish causation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符号付き変化量は%@です。この2つの観測値の差だけでは、因果関係は立証できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed contrast is 42−30=12. Without assignment or a counterfactual design, the table supplies association rather than a causal effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signed contrast is 42−30=12. Without assignment or a counterfactual design, the table supplies association rather than a causal effect."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "署名された対照は42−30=12です。割り当てや逆事実設計なしで、テーブルは因果効果ではなく関連性を提供します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed difference is %@ − %@ = %@. The labels support that arithmetic comparison, but two observations alone do not identify a causal effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The signed difference is %1$@ − %2$@ = %3$@. The labels support that arithmetic comparison, but two observations alone do not identify a causal effect."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符号付き差は%@ − %@ = %@です。ラベルによりこの算術比較は妥当ですが、2つの観測値だけでは因果効果を特定できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed private-iCloud deletion capability is unavailable. Nothing was deleted.": {
      "comment": "Complete private-iCloud deletion failure when the signed capability is unavailable.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "署名済みのプライベートiCloud削除機能を利用できません。何も削除されていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed structured store is configured, but the custom document-original sync engine could not be installed for this launch.": {
      "comment": "Private original custom-zone engine unavailable status.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "署名済みの構造化ストアは設定されていますが、この起動では書類の元ファイル用カスタム同期エンジンをインストールできませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The single-pass algorithm grows linearly; the nested-pair algorithm grows quadratically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シングルパス アルゴリズムは直線的に増加します。ネストされたペアのアルゴリズムは二次関数的に増加します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The siren cannot sound for any other reason.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The siren cannot sound for any other reason."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サイレンが鳴らないのは、他の理由がある場合を除きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skills that can help you most right now.": {
      "comment": "Runtime localization key rendered through a custom String-taking component.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今のあなたに最も役立つスキルです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skip could not be saved. The item remains on screen so no evidence is lost.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スキップを保存できませんでした。アイテムは画面上に残るため、証拠が失われることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slope predicts 2 additional kWh/day per additional occupied hour/day among otherwise comparable in-range buildings; at x=5, y=14 kWh/day. The observational coefficient alone is not causal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The slope predicts 2 additional kWh/day per additional occupied hour/day among otherwise comparable in-range buildings; at x=5, y=14 kWh/day. The observational coefficient alone is not causal."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "斜面は、それ以外に同等の範囲内の建物の中で、占有される追加時間/日のあたり2kWh/日の追加を予測します。x=5、y=14 kWh/日の観察係数だけでは因果関係はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slope term has units (min/km)(km)=min, so it can be added to the 12 min intercept. Substitution gives T=12+0.8×15=24 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The slope term has units (min/km)(km)=min, so it can be added to the 12 min intercept. Substitution gives T=12+0.8×15=24 minutes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾配項には単位（min/km）（km）=minがあるので、12分の交差点に追加できます。代入すると、T=12+0.8×15=24分になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smaller extent is limiting, and 2 moles of C form per reaction extent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The smaller extent is limiting, and 2 moles of C form per reaction extent."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小さい方の反応進行度が限定となり、反応進行度1あたり2 molのCが生成されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source counts cards and gives time in minutes. The target measures liquid and gives time in seconds, so its duration must be divided by 60 before combining it with a per-minute rate. This mapping would need revision if the flow changed, liquid was lost, or the container already held liquid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source counts cards and gives time in minutes. The target measures liquid and gives time in seconds, so its duration must be divided by 60 before combining it with a per-minute rate. This mapping would need revision if the flow changed, liquid was lost, or the container already held liquid."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元の課題はカードの枚数を数え、時間を分で示します。新しい課題は液体の量を測り、時間を秒で示すため、毎分のレートと組み合わせる前に時間を60で割る必要があります。流量が変わる、液体が失われる、または初めから容器に液体がある場合は、この対応付けを修正する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source is stored, but it has no readable excerpt for source review. Open it to inspect the extracted text or import a text-based copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source is stored, but it has no readable excerpt for source review. Open it to inspect the extracted text or import a text-based copy."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ソースは保存されていますが、レビューに使える読み取り可能な抜粋がありません。ソースを開いて抽出テキストを確認するか、テキスト形式のコピーを読み込んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source may have been deleted. Your saved answers remain in History.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source may have been deleted. Your saved answers remain in History."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料が削除された可能性があります。保存した回答は履歴に残っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The specified increment must be applied exactly once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定した増分は 1 回だけ適用する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The split unit must match the intended generalization unit, such as person, site, or future time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The split unit must match the intended generalization unit, such as person, site, or future time."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分割ユニットは、人、場所、または将来の時間など、意図する一般化ユニットと一致する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The squared term is smallest at zero, which occurs when x − 6 = 0; therefore the minimum is at x = 6.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The squared term is smallest at zero, which occurs when x − 6 = 0; therefore the minimum is at x = 6."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平方項はゼロで最小であり、これはx − 6 = 0の場合に発生します。したがって、最小値はx = 6にあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The starting skill check is optional": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始時スキルチェックは任意です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stated interval runs from %@ to %@, so its width is %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The stated interval runs from %@ to %@, so its width is %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明示された区間は%@から%@なので、幅は%@です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stated lower bound is 2×40=80 Hz. Practical reconstruction may require margin above this ideal boundary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The stated lower bound is 2×40=80 Hz. Practical reconstruction may require margin above this ideal boundary."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "述べた下限は2×40=80 Hzです。実用的な再構築には、この理想的な境界上の余白が必要になる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The statement applies universally beyond every condition in the material.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この記述は、マテリアル内のあらゆる条件を超えて普遍的に適用されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The steady-state balance is production=degradationRate×mRNA. Solving for the stock places degradation in the denominator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The steady-state balance is production=degradationRate×mRNA. Solving for the stock places degradation in the denominator."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steady-stateバランスは、生産物=降解率×mRNAです。分母の降解する場所の在庫を解く。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strict upper bound stops after n − 1, so the requested final term never enters the sum.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "厳密な上限ではn − 1で停止するため、求める最後の項が合計に入りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The structured CloudKit store is unavailable; local writes continue.": {
      "comment": "Structured private-iCloud unavailable status.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "構造化CloudKitストアを利用できません。ローカルへの書き込みは継続します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The structured CloudKit store remains active for this launch and turns off after reopening.": {
      "comment": "Structured private-iCloud disable restart guidance.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この起動中は構造化CloudKitストアが有効なままです。開き直すと無効になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The structured text returned by the Use Model action in Shortcuts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The structured text returned by the Use Model action in Shortcuts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ショートカットの「モデルを使用」アクションから返された構造化テキストです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The student inverted the coefficients. Multiply 4 mol N₂ by (3 mol H₂)/(1 mol N₂), which cancels mol N₂ and gives 12 mol H₂.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The student inverted the coefficients. Multiply 4 mol N₂ by (3 mol H₂)/(1 mol N₂), which cancels mol N₂ and gives 12 mol H₂."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その学生は係数を反転させました。4mol N2を（3mol H2）/（1mol N2）で掛け合わせると、mol N2が消えて12mol H2になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sum factors as two times an integer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和を整数の2倍として因数分解できる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sum is 50.5 cm; dividing by five gives a mean of 10.1 cm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sum is 50.5 cm; dividing by five gives a mean of 10.1 cm."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計は50.5cmです。5で割ると平均10.1cmになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The supplied implication only runs from verified to publishable; its converse was not given.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与えられた含意は、検証済みから公開可能への一方向だけです。その逆は与えられていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The supported answer restates the cited sentence without strengthening, reversing, or universalizing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裏づけられた解答は、引用文を強めたり、向きを逆にしたり、普遍化したりせずに述べ直しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The surface nouns changed, but the constant-rate accumulation structure and unit cancellation remain the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表面名詞は変わりましたが、定率蓄積構造や単位解除はそのままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The surface setting changes from one batch size to another, but proportional scaling preserves each ingredient ratio. Scaling only flour would break the recipe constraint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The surface setting changes from one batch size to another, but proportional scaling preserves each ingredient ratio. Scaling only flour would break the recipe constraint."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーフェス設定はバッチサイズによって異なりますが、比例整列は各成分比率を保持します。小麦粉のみを比例整列すると、レシピ制約が破れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The syntax uses an integer": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "構文は整数を使用します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The table has intercept %lld and constant change %lld, so y equals %lldx plus %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The table has intercept %1$lld and constant change %2$lld, so y equals %3$lldx plus %4$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テーブルには切片 %1$lld と定数変化 %2$lld があるため、y は %3$lldx に %4$lld を加えたものと等しくなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The table increases by %lld per unit x, not its reciprocal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テーブルは、その逆数ではなく、ユニット x ごとに %1$lld ずつ増加します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target lies one quarter of the way from input 2 to 6, so add one quarter of the output change: %@ + [%@ − %@]/4 = %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The target lies one quarter of the way from input 2 to 6, so add one quarter of the output change: %@ + [%@ − %@]/4 = %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "対象の入力は2から6までの4分の1の位置にあるため、出力変化の4分の1を加えます：%@ + [%@ − %@]/4 = %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target total is %lld %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The target total is %lld %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しい課題の合計量は%lld%@です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target total retains the counted-item unit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目標合計はカウント項目単位を保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target, prediction unit, data-generating population, and metric must be declared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The target, prediction unit, data-generating population, and metric must be declared."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ターゲット、予測単位、データ生成集団、メトリックを宣言する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task is timed": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タスクには時間制限があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text returned by the Use Model action in Shortcuts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The text returned by the Use Model action in Shortcuts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ショートカットの「モデルを使用」アクションが返したテキスト。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The theorem’s hypotheses are satisfied, and solving f′(c)=4 locates the interior point whose tangent is parallel to the secant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The theorem’s hypotheses are satisfied, and solving f′(c)=4 locates the interior point whose tangent is parallel to the secant."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定理の仮説を満たしており、f′(c)=4を解くと、正弦に接線が平行な内接点を求めることができます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The total is 20×10+10×16=360; dividing by 30 gives 12. Averaging 10 and 16 equally would ignore unequal group sizes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The total is 20×10+10×16=360; dividing by 30 gives 12. Averaging 10 and 16 equally would ignore unequal group sizes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計は20×10+10×16=360です。30で割ると12になります。平均して10と16を等しくすると、不均一なグループサイズを無視します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trace uses the wrong whole as its percentage base.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "トレースでは、パーセンテージのベースとして間違った全体が使用されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transferred amount is conserved. Multiplying by finalVolume/stockVolume reverses the dilution and makes concentration increase.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移した物質量は保存されます。finalVolume/stockVolumeを掛けると希釈比が逆になり、濃度が上昇してしまいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transferred rate relationship was applied incorrectly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "転移されたレート関係が誤って適用されました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transition scales the prior state; it is not wholly additive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遷移は前の状態をスケーリングします。完全に添加物ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transition's multiplication is evaluated before its one-time increment, giving %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "トランジションの乗算は 1 回の増分の前に評価され、%1$lld が得られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treatment and control receive different handling steps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The treatment and control receive different handling steps."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "治療とコントロールは異なる処理手順を受けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treatment group had a higher observed mean than the control group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "治療グループは対照グループよりも高い観察平均値を示しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treatment label itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "トリートメントラベル自体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treatment mean is %lld, higher than the control mean of %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The treatment mean is %1$lld, higher than the control mean of %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "治療平均値は %1$lld で、対照平均値 %2$lld よりも高くなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two conjugate bases have identical strength.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The two conjugate bases have identical strength."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二つの共軛塩基は同じ強さを持っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two explicit premises are P and P → R, so R follows by modus ponens. No converse or source-truth claim is needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明示された2つの前提はPとP → Rなので、モーダスポネンスによってRが導かれます。逆や、資料自体が真であるという主張は必要ありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two identical recursive calls are recomputed rather than shared. A depth-n binary recursion tree has exponentially many nodes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The two identical recursive calls are recomputed rather than shared. A depth-n binary recursion tree has exponentially many nodes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ二つの再帰呼び出しは、共有されるのではなく再計算されます。深さ-nのバイナリ再帰ツリーには、指数関数的に多くのノードがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two simultaneous changes combine multiplicatively, not additively.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 つの同時変化は加算的にではなく乗算的に結合します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The underlying relation is preserved while the representation changes": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表現が変化しても、基礎となる関係は維持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The units are percentages": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単位はパーセントです"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unstarted circuit was safely recalculated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The unstarted circuit was safely recalculated."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未開始のサーキットを安全に再計算しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The valid contrapositive is not-even → not-divisible-by-4. Being odd and prime adds an unsupported property: odd composite values also satisfy the premise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The valid contrapositive is not-even → not-divisible-by-4. Being odd and prime adds an unsupported property: odd composite values also satisfy the premise."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有効な反消極は、偶数ではない→4で割り切れない。奇数で素数であることは、サポートされていないプロパティを追加します。奇数の複合値も前提を満たします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The value does not reproduce the original product when multiplied forward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この値は、順方向に乗算しても元の積を再現しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The value follows from the stated quantities without changing scale or units.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "値は、スケールや単位を変更せずに、記載された数量から導き出されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The value is equivalent, but the coefficient is not normalized.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "値は同等ですが、係数は正規化されていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The values are not labeled as comparable, so a signed change is not defined.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "値が比較可能なものとして示されていないため、符号付き変化量は定義できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The values support a shared association across representations, while the absent intervention limits causal inference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "値は表現間の共有された関連性をサポートしますが、介入が存在しないと因果関係の推論が制限されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The variable rows holds the actual pipeline state. Reading raw input again bypasses the validation transformation and makes the metric irreproducible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The variable rows holds the actual pipeline state. Reading raw input again bypasses the validation transformation and makes the metric irreproducible."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可変行は実際のパイプライン状態を保持します。生の入力を再び読み込むと、検証変換がバイパスされ、メトリックが再現不可能です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vehicle control isolates the candidate compound, the known-active agonist tests assay sensitivity, and the mock-handled sample tests whether the procedure itself creates fluorescence. None can substitute for the other roles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The vehicle control isolates the candidate compound, the known-active agonist tests assay sensitivity, and the mock-handled sample tests whether the procedure itself creates fluorescence. None can substitute for the other roles."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "車両制御は、候補化合物、既知の活性アゴニストがアッセイ感度をテストし、模擬ハンドサンプルが手順自体が蛍光を作成するかどうかをテストします。 他の役割に代わるものはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vertical scale starts at zero and shows observation counts. Inspect either outcome for its exact value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The vertical scale starts at zero and shows observation counts. Inspect either outcome for its exact value."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "縦軸はゼロから始まり、観測数を示します。どちらかの結果を選ぶと正確な値を確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The viewing direction is the coordinate removed from the screen representation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The viewing direction is the coordinate removed from the screen representation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示方向は、画面表示から削除された座標です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wave relation v=fλ gives λ=v/f=12/3=4 m.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The wave relation v=fλ gives λ=v/f=12/3=4 m."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "波動関係v=fλはλ=v/f=12/3=4mを与えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole is the percentage base; converting the percent to a decimal multiplier before applying it produces the supported share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The whole is the percentage base; converting the percent to a decimal multiplier before applying it produces the supported share."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全体が百分率の基準です。パーセントを小数の乗数に変換してから適用すると、根拠のある割合が得られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The work call executes n² times.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The work call executes n² times."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ワークコールはn²回実行されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The work reports a final result but never states or checks the governing invariant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The work reports a final result but never states or checks the governing invariant."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この作業は最終結果を報告しますが、支配的不変数を述べることも、確認することもあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workshop group could also score differently because participants had different prior skill.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workshop group could also score differently because participants had different prior skill."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参加者の事前の技能が異なることによっても、ワークショップ参加グループの得点に差が生じる可能性があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workshop group could score differently because of the workshop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workshop group could score differently because of the workshop."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ワークショップの効果により、参加グループの得点に差が生じる可能性があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workshop group had the higher observed final score.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workshop group had the higher observed final score."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "観測された最終得点は、ワークショップ参加グループの方が高かった。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workshop group had the lower observed final score.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workshop group had the lower observed final score."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "観測された最終得点は、ワークショップ参加グループの方が低かった。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workshop mean was %lld points; the comparison mean was %lld points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workshop mean was %lld points; the comparison mean was %lld points."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ワークショップ参加グループの平均は%lld点、比較グループの平均は%lld点だった。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The worst-case lookup time": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The worst-case lookup time"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最悪の場合の検索時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The x effect is ∂y/∂x=2+4z; at z=2 it is 2+8=10.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The x effect is ∂y/∂x=2+4z; at z=2 it is 2+8=10."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "x効果は∂y/∂x=2+4z; z=2では2+8=10です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ± value is half the full band width.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ± value is half the full band width."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "±の値は、フルバンド幅の半分です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ± value is half the total width.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ± value is half the total width."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "±の値は全体の幅の半分です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The −15 already carries its direction. Subtracting it a second time reverses that step and breaks path independence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The −15 already carries its direction. Subtracting it a second time reverses that step and breaks path independence."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "−15はすでにその方向を帯びています。それを2回差し引くと、そのステップが逆転し、パス独立性が壊れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are %lld true-positive flags and %lld false-positive flags.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "There are %1$lld true-positive flags and %2$lld false-positive flags."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 真陽性フラグと %2$lld 偽陽性フラグがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are 100 diseased people, giving 0.80×100=80 true positives. Among 900 without disease, the 10% false-positive rate gives 90 false positives.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are 100 diseased people, giving 0.80×100=80 true positives. Among 900 without disease, the 10% false-positive rate gives 90 false positives."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "病気のある人は100人いて、0.80×100=80の真陽性を与えています。病気のない900人のうち、10%の偽陽性率は90の偽陽性を与えています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are two groups": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの群がある"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are two pivot variables and one free variable. Expressing the pivots in terms of z produces one independent null direction.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are two pivot variables and one free variable. Expressing the pivots in terms of z produces one independent null direction."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピボット変数が2つ、自由変数が1つあります。ピボットをzの観点から表すと、1つの独立した空の方向が生成されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no adjacent band in that direction. Choose an available band explicitly.": {
      "comment": "Reviewed practice challenge control; never a demonstrated ability claim.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no adjacent band in that direction. Choose an available band explicitly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その方向に隣接する段階はありません。利用できる段階を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no optional maintenance waiting to run.": {
      "comment": "Runtime background-maintenance detail shown in Settings.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行待ちの任意メンテナンスはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no uncertainty because the interval endpoints are numerical.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "間隔のエンドポイントは数値であるため、不確実性はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermochemistry and spontaneity": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "熱化学と自発性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermodynamics and statistical reasoning": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "熱力学と統計的推論"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are preferences, not verified credentials. You can change every choice later.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらは設定であり、検証された資格情報ではありません。すべての選択肢は後で変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These changes have not been acknowledged by local storage. Discarding leaves the last saved version unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These changes have not been acknowledged by local storage. Discarding leaves the last saved version unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの変更は、このデバイスへの保存が確認できていません。変更を破棄しても、最後に保存した内容は変わりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These question sets may differ in difficulty and support. Their averages do not establish transfer of learning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These question sets may differ in difficulty and support. Their averages do not establish transfer of learning."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問題セットによって難易度や支援の程度が異なる場合があります。平均値だけでは学習の転移を確認できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These questions don’t yet have reviewed time estimates. You can choose five questions and work at your own pace.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These questions don’t yet have reviewed time estimates. You can choose five questions and work at your own pace."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの問題には、検証済みの所要時間がまだありません。5問を選び、自分のペースで取り組めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These reviews are no longer ready. The queue has been refreshed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These reviews are no longer ready. The queue has been refreshed."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの復習は現在の対象ではなくなりました。復習一覧を更新しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These saved answers do not include the complete timing and task context needed for a speed estimate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These saved answers do not include the complete timing and task context needed for a speed estimate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの保存済みの回答には、速度の推定に必要な時間と課題の情報がそろっていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings change how practice feels, not your progress.": {
      "comment": "Runtime localization key rendered through a custom String-taking component.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの設定は練習の進め方を変えますが、進捗には影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These tasks sample defined debugging and reasoning mechanics, not overall programming ability or proof expertise.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらのタスクは、全体的なプログラミング能力や証明の専門知識ではなく、定義されたデバッグおよび推論メカニズムのサンプルです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These tools change a demonstration copy. Camera movement and your saved answer stay separate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These tools change a demonstration copy. Camera movement and your saved answer stay separate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作するのは説明用のコピーです。カメラの移動と保存済みの解答には影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Think about the composition of the positive-test denominator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Think about the composition of the positive-test denominator."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "陽性判定分母の構成について考えてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Think about the correction. You can choose a reason, write a note, or leave this for later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Think about the correction. You can choose a reason, write a note, or leave this for later."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解説を参考に振り返ってみましょう。理由やメモを残すことも、あとにすることもできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Think of 29 as one less than 30.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Think of 29 as one less than 30."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "29を「30より1少ない数」と考えてみましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Think of a starting point and a rule for reaching the next point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始点と、次の点へ進む規則を考えてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This activity mixes reviewed families. Each family keeps its own challenge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This activity mixes reviewed families. Each family keeps its own challenge."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この活動では、レビュー済みの複数の分野を練習します。難しさは分野ごとに調整されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This answer may have been deleted. Return to History to choose another answer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This answer may have been deleted. Return to History to choose another answer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この回答は削除された可能性があります。履歴に戻り、別の回答を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build has no verified private-CloudKit entitlement, so the structured store is local-only.": {
      "comment": "Structured private-iCloud missing-entitlement status.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このビルドには検証済みのプライベートCloudKitエンタイトルメントがないため、構造化ストアはローカル専用です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This choice focuses the activity on the shown reviewed family.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This choice focuses the activity on the shown reviewed family."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この選択では、表示されている確認済みの問題群に絞って練習します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This citation did not retain a content revision, so the current source cannot be verified as the original.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This citation did not retain a content revision, so the current source cannot be verified as the original."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この出典には内容の改訂版が保存されていないため、現在のソースが元の内容と一致することを確認できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears the active latency samples and returns the preferred answer mode to adaptive. Correctness, mastery, answers, and prior exported records are unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This clears the active latency samples and returns the preferred answer mode to adaptive. Correctness, mastery, answers, and prior exported records are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有効な遅延サンプルを消去し、優先回答モードを適応設定に戻します。正誤、習熟度、回答、以前に書き出した記録は変更されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This comparison cannot separate a workshop effect from differences in prior skill.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This comparison cannot separate a workshop effect from differences in prior skill."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この比較では、ワークショップの効果と事前の技能の違いを切り分けられない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This conditional result is requested as a percentage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この条件付き結果はパーセンテージとして要求されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes NeuroForge data from iCloud and this device. You may be asked to reopen the app so deletion can finish and be verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes NeuroForge data from iCloud and this device. You may be asked to reopen the app so deletion can finish and be verified."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloudとこのデバイスからNeuroForgeのデータを削除します。削除を完了して確認するために、アプリを再度開くよう求められる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes only this device’s profile, training attempts, imported copies, caches, and private-sync queue. It turns off sync for the next launch and does not claim to delete private iCloud copies. If private structured sync is active now, NeuroForge asks you to reopen before retrying so local deletion cannot propagate remotely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この操作で削除されるのは、このデバイス上のプロファイル、トレーニング履歴、読み込んだコピー、キャッシュ、プライベート同期キューだけです。次回起動時の同期をオフにしますが、プライベートiCloud上のコピーを削除するとは示しません。現在プライベート構造化同期が有効な場合は、ローカル削除がリモートへ伝播しないよう、NeuroForgeが再起動後の再試行を案内します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes your profile, practice history, imported copies, and caches from this device. Data already in iCloud is not deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes your profile, practice history, imported copies, and caches from this device. Data already in iCloud is not deleted."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロフィール、練習履歴、インポートしたコピー、キャッシュをこのデバイスから削除します。iCloudに保存済みのデータは削除されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このデバイス"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device + iCloud": {
      "comment": "Runtime localization key rendered through a custom String-taking component.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このデバイス＋iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device’s open database is cleared and its account-scoped store purge is scheduled. Quit and reopen NeuroForge once more so it can verify removal before opening any database.": {
      "comment": "Expected restart boundary after local cleanup schedules deletion of the currently open structured store.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このデバイスで開いていたデータベースを消去し、アカウント別ストアの削除を予約しました。データベースを開く前に削除を確認できるよう、NeuroForgeをもう一度終了して開き直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This diagnostic is score-preserving: it reconstructs the seeded steps but never changes the submitted attempt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この診断はスコアを保持します。シードから手順を再構築しますが、送信済みの回答履歴は変更しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This diagram cannot be rendered safely. Its original description is retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This diagram cannot be rendered safely. Its original description is retained."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この図は安全に表示できません。元の説明は保持されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This discrete logistic update combines current abundance with density dependence. Checking N=200 gives zero increment, which establishes the stated boundary behavior.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This discrete logistic update combines current abundance with density dependence. Checking N=200 gives zero increment, which establishes the stated boundary behavior."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この離散ロジスティクス更新は、現在の豊かさと密度依存性を組み合わせます。 N=200をチェックすると、ゼロの増分が与えられ、これは述べる境界挙動を確立します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document is excluded from AI-generated questions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This document is excluded from AI-generated questions."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この文書はAI生成の質問から除外されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This earlier algebraic step is valid; the failure occurs when a zero factor is canceled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この初期の代数ステップは有効です。失敗はゼロ要素がキャンセルされたときに発生します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This editor": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This editor"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この編集画面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This equation matches neither the constant ratio nor every table row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この式は、一定の比率にもテーブルのすべての行にも一致しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This excerpt does not define a labeled numerical relationship. How many explicit numeric values does the cited excerpt contain? Return only the number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この抜粋には、ラベルで示された数値関係が定義されていません。引用された抜粋に明示されている数値はいくつありますか。数値だけを回答してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This explanation is recorded as support. It does not change final-answer credit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
