    "This fixed question set stays saved. Start a separate reviewed activity for the remaining questions.": {
      "comment": "Reviewed practice challenge control; never a demonstrated ability claim.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
