      }
    },
    "This is a synthetic teaching study. Participants chose whether to join %@. Prior skill predicts the final score. Both groups completed the same final test, but assignment was not randomized.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a synthetic teaching study. Participants chose whether to join %@. Prior skill predicts the final score. Both groups completed the same final test, but assignment was not randomized."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これは学習用に作られた架空の研究です。参加者は%@に参加するかを自分で選びました。事前の技能は最終得点を予測します。両グループは同じ最終テストを受けましたが、グループ分けは無作為ではありませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an item-level pattern, not a trait or diagnosis.": {
