    "To dilute 50 mL of 2.0 M stock to 0.50 M, a student rearranges solute conservation as V₂=C₂V₁/C₁ and obtains 12.5 mL. Diagnose the inverted concentration ratio, derive the correct expression for V₂, and calculate the physically consistent final volume.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To dilute 50 mL of 2.0 M stock to 0.50 M, a student rearranges solute conservation as V₂=C₂V₁/C₁ and obtains 12.5 mL. Diagnose the inverted concentration ratio, derive the correct expression for V₂, and calculate the physically consistent final volume."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.0 Mのストックを0.50 Mに希薄化するには、溶質保全をV₂=C₂V₁/C₁として再配置し、12.5 mLを得ます。逆濃度比を診断し、V2の正しい式を導き出し、物理的に一致する最終体積を計算します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To estimate performance on unseen data": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目に見えないデータのパフォーマンスを推定するには"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To find": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To find"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "求める量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To provide a comparison for the treatment effect": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "治療効果を比較するため"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To test a growth factor, cells with high baseline growth are preferentially assigned treatment while low-growth cells enter control. Give the smallest assignment repair and name the threat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To test a growth factor, cells with high baseline growth are preferentially assigned treatment while low-growth cells enter control. Give the smallest assignment repair and name the threat."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "成長因子のテストでは、ベースライン成長率の高い細胞に優先的に治療を割り当てるとともに、成長率の低い細胞をコントロール細胞に入れます。最小割り当て修復を与え、脅威に名前を付けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
