    "Two %@ categories contain %@ and %@ %@. Compute the first-to-second ratio and explain what is held in the denominator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Two %@ categories contain %@ and %@ %@. Compute the first-to-second ratio and explain what is held in the denominator."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの%@カテゴリには%@と%@ %@が含まれます。1番目と2番目の比を計算し、分母に何を置いたか説明してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two %@ groups choose their own treatment, and their outcomes differ. What most directly blocks a causal conclusion?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの%1$@の群がそれぞれ処置を自分で選び、結果に差がありました。因果的な結論を最も直接的に妨げるものは何ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two 6 Ω resistors are connected in parallel across 12 V. What total source current in amperes follows from branch-current conservation? Return only the number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two 6 Ω resistors are connected in parallel across 12 V. What total source current in amperes follows from branch-current conservation? Return only the number."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの6Ω抵抗器が12Vに並列に接続されています。分岐電流の節約によって、アンペア単位で合計のソース電流はどれですか？数字だけを返してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two candidate models fit every point used to construct them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Two candidate models fit every point used to construct them."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの候補モデルは、それらを構築するために使用されるすべてのポイントに適合します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two collinear horizontal forces, +18 kN and −7 kN, act on a joint. What is the signed resultant in kN? Return only the number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two collinear horizontal forces, +18 kN and −7 kN, act on a joint. What is the signed resultant in kN? Return only the number."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二つの長列平行力、+18 kNと−7 kNが接合部に作用します。kNで符号付きの根因は何ですか？数字のみを返します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two evidence connections and one experimental-design decision": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two evidence connections and one experimental-design decision"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの根拠の対応付けと1つの実験計画の選択"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two genes show 12 recombinant offspring among 100 total offspring. What estimated map distance and linkage interpretation best fit this result?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two genes show 12 recombinant offspring among 100 total offspring. What estimated map distance and linkage interpretation best fit this result?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つの遺伝子は、合計100の子孫のうち12の子孫を発見しました。この結果に最も適した推定地図距離と連結解釈は何ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two groups have means 10 (n=20) and 16 (n=10). Compute the pooled mean across all 30 observations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two groups have means 10 (n=20) and 16 (n=10). Compute the pooled mean across all 30 observations."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2つのグループは10（n=20）と16（n=10）の平均値を持っています。30の観測値全体にわたるプール平均値を計算します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two groups in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
