    "Under the stated acquisition-window/sample-bin convention, duration=sample count/sampling rate=1000/250=4 s. The first and last timestamps span one sample interval less, which is a different convention.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under the stated acquisition-window/sample-bin convention, duration=sample count/sampling rate=1000/250=4 s. The first and last timestamps span one sample interval less, which is a different convention."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記載されている取得ウィンドウ/サンプルフビン規則の下で、期間=サンプルフカウント/サンプリングレート=1000/250=4秒。最初と最後のタイムスタンプは、サンプルフレンジを1インターバル短縮します。これは別の規則です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the stated common solvent and temperature, the weaker acid has smaller Ka and therefore the stronger conjugate base through KaKb=Kw. The nearest distractor incorrectly makes acid and conjugate-base strengths vary together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under the stated common solvent and temperature, the weaker acid has smaller Ka and therefore the stronger conjugate base through KaKb=Kw. The nearest distractor incorrectly makes acid and conjugate-base strengths vary together."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "述べた共通の溶剤と温度の下で、弱い酸はより小さなKaを持ち、したがって、KaKb=Kwを通じたより強い共有基底を持っています。最も近い変数は、酸と共有基底の強度が一緒に異なるように誤って行使します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the stated nonnegative-index invariant, use low + (high−low)/2; low+high can overflow even when both indices are valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under the stated nonnegative-index invariant, use low + (high−low)/2; low+high can overflow even when both indices are valid."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "述べる負の指数不変性の下で、low + (high−low)/2を使用します。低+高は、両方の指数が有効な場合でもオーバーフローする可能性があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undergraduate": {
      "comment": "Education or career stage option during onboarding.",
