          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update what you study and how practice feels.": {
      "comment": "Runtime localization key rendered through a custom String-taking component.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学ぶ内容と練習の進め方を変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating confidence after a bounded set of comparable tasks": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比較可能なタスクの制限されたセットの後に確信度を更新する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次を使う"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use\n\n$$C_2 = \\frac{C_1V_1}{V_2}$$": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次を使ってください\n\n$$C_2 = \\frac{C_1V_1}{V_2}$$"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@ in a new context or format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@を新しい文脈や形式で使ってみましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %lld = %lld %@ 1 and compensate once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Use %1$lld = %2$lld %3$@ 1 and compensate once."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld = %2$lld %3$@ 1を利用し、1回だけ補正してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use 1 gram = 1,000 milligrams, so divide the numeric value by 1,000 and retain mass units.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 グラム = 1,000 ミリグラムを使用するため、数値を 1,000 で割って質量単位を維持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use 1% solvent without compound as the negative/vehicle control to detect solvent effects; use a validated receptor agonist as the known-active positive control to show the assay can produce signal; and process a mock sample through staining and imaging as the procedural control to reveal handling or measurement artifacts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use 1% solvent without compound as the negative/vehicle control to detect solvent effects; use a validated receptor agonist as the known-active positive control to show the assay can produce signal; and process a mock sample through staining and imaging as the procedural control to reveal handling or measurement artifacts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "溶媒効果を検出するために、化合物を含まない溶媒1%を陰性/載体コントロールとして使用し、アッセイが信号を生成できることを示すために、既知の活性陽性コントロールとして検証済みの受容体アゴニストを使用し、手順制御として染色とイメージングを通じて模擬サンプルのプロセスを実行して、取り扱いや測定アーティファクトを明らかにします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use 3 mol H₂ per 1 mol N₂, not its reciprocal; 4×3=12 mol H₂.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use 3 mol H₂ per 1 mol N₂, not its reciprocal; 4×3=12 mol H₂."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逆数ではなく、1mol N2あたり3mol H2を使用してください。4×3=12mol H2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use 30/12=2.5 times the recipe, so flour is 750×2.5=1,875 g. The ingredient-per-roll ratio must remain constant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use 30/12=2.5 times the recipe, so flour is 750×2.5=1,875 g. The ingredient-per-roll ratio must remain constant."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レシピの30/12=2.5倍を使用するので、小麦粉は750×2.5=1,875gです。ロールあたりの材料比率は一定でなければなりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use A_to_C=A_to_B+B_to_C=25, not 40−(−15)=55.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use A_to_C=A_to_B+B_to_C=25, not 40−(−15)=55."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A_to_C=A_to_B+B_to_C=25ではなく、40−(−15)=55を使用してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Bellman–Ford because the graph has a negative edge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グラフに負の辺があるため、Bellman–Ford 法を使用してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use FIFO order for the discovered frontier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use FIFO order for the discovered frontier."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "検出されたフロンティアに対して、FIFO順序を使用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Move up or Move down, or the Up and Down arrow keys, to change this step’s position.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Move up or Move down, or the Up and Down arrow keys, to change this step’s position."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「上へ移動」「下へ移動」、または上下の矢印キーで、この手順の位置を変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Newton’s second law F=ma, so a=F/m. Constant acceleration from rest gives v=at=Ft/m. At t=0, v=0; and (N·s)/kg=(kg·m/s²·s)/kg=m/s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Newton’s second law F=ma, so a=F/m. Constant acceleration from rest gives v=at=Ft/m. At t=0, v=0; and (N·s)/kg=(kg·m/s²·s)/kg=m/s."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ニュートンの第二法則F=maを使用します。したがって、a=F/m。静止状態からの一定加速度は、v=at=Ft/mを与えます。t=0、v=0;そして（N·s）/kg=(kg·m/s²·s）/kg=m/s。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
