    "Use a crossed factorial design with drought versus normal moisture and competitor present versus removed across randomized replicated plots; a drought main effect supports forcing, while a drought-by-competitor interaction shows that competition changes the drought response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
