            "value": "ネットワークを使用して、負の摩擦仕事を含む動能を更新します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use observed minus predicted for every row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use observed minus predicted for every row."
          }
