    },
    "Uses nonvisual alternatives. Spatial progress will stay blank.": {
      "comment": "Runtime localization key rendered through a custom String-taking component.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "視覚を使わない代替問題を使用します。空間スキルの進捗は空欄のままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses simpler transitions and avoids unnecessary movement.": {
      "comment": "Runtime catalog key used by a custom view or static user-facing content table.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "よりシンプルなトランジションを使用し、不必要な動きを避けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the offline question engine only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフライン問題作成エンジンのみを使用します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses your profile’s training days: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロファイルのトレーニング日数を使用します: %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using all time points reveals a repeated one-month lag that two endpoints would hide. Temporal order is useful evidence, but the observational sequence alone does not isolate the mechanism.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using all time points reveals a repeated one-month lag that two endpoints would hide. Temporal order is useful evidence, but the observational sequence alone does not isolate the mechanism."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての時点を使用すると、重複した1か月のラグが明らかになり、2つのエンドポイントが隠されます。時間的順序は有用な証拠ですが、観察シーケンスだけではメカニズムを切り離すことはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using fallback": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フォールバックを使用中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using only the limit definition": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using only the limit definition"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "極限の定義だけを使って"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using only the limit definition\n\n$$f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h},$$\n\nderive the derivative of $$f(x)=x^2$$. Show the cancellation that makes the limit finite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "極限の定義\n\n$$f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h},$$\n\nだけを使って $$f(x)=x^2$$ の導関数を導いてください。極限を有限にする約分も示してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using phenotype counts as genotype counts without accounting for dominance creates a hidden-state error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Using phenotype counts as genotype counts without accounting for dominance creates a hidden-state error."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "優位性を考慮せずに表現型のカウントを遺伝型のカウントとして使用すると、隠し状態エラーが発生します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using the limit definition $$f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h},$$ derive the derivative of $$f(x)=x^2$$ and show the cancellation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using the limit definition $$f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h},$$ derive the derivative of $$f(x)=x^2$$ and show the cancellation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "極限定義$$f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$$を使用して$$f(x)=x^2$$の導関数を導出し、キャンセルを示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using the stated ideal lower-bound rule fs≥2fmax, a signal contains a highest frequency of 40 Hz. What minimum sampling rate does the rule give?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using the stated ideal lower-bound rule fs≥2fmax, a signal contains a highest frequency of 40 Hz. What minimum sampling rate does the rule give?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "述べた理想的な下限ルールfs≥2fmaxを使用すると、信号には最高周波数40Hzが含まれます。 ルールはどの最低サンプリングレートを与えますか?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using this skill in a new context may help.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このスキルを新しい文脈で使うと役立つ可能性があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid counterexample": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有効な反例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid transfer identifies the target, maps its structure, solves, and then rechecks assumptions and units.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "妥当な転移では、対象を特定して構造を対応づけ、解いた後に仮定と単位を再確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid transfer preserves the underlying structure and rechecks assumptions, units, and constraints in the target context.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有効な転移では、基礎となる構造が保存され、ターゲット コンテキストの前提、単位、制約が再チェックされます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid zero-based indices are zero through count minus one, exactly captured by index less than count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有効なゼロベースのインデックスは 0 から count マイナス 1 までであり、count 未満のインデックスによって正確にキャプチャされます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validate patches against boundary tests": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "境界テストに対してパッチを検証する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validate that every edge weight is nonnegative before Dijkstra runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダイクストラ法を実行する前に、すべての辺の重みが非負であることを検証してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validate/parse age explicitly and quarantine or represent failures as missing; silently converting failure to 0 corrupts the feature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Validate/parse age explicitly and quarantine or represent failures as missing; silently converting failure to 0 corrupts the feature."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年齢を明示的に検証/解析し、障害を隔離または不在として表す。障害を静かに0に変換すると、機能が破損する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validates an authoring response and returns it to NeuroForge for review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Validates an authoring response and returns it to NeuroForge for review."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
