    "Vary both axes currently fixed by the single observation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vary both axes currently fixed by the single observation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在、単一の観測によって固定されている両軸を変化させる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vary notch and porosity independently and observe where each crack begins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vary notch and porosity independently and observe where each crack begins."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ノッチと多孔率を独立して変化させ、各亀裂がどこから始まるのか観察します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vary the assumption across a declared range and report conclusion sensitivity.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Vary the assumption across a declared range and report conclusion sensitivity."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "宣言された範囲全体で仮定を変更し、結論の感度を報告します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vary the setting that the universal claim crosses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vary the setting that the universal claim crosses."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ユニバーサルクレームが交差する設定を変更します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Varying both candidate causes independently prevents either from being a proxy for the other. The interaction term directly tests whether the competitor modifies sensitivity to environmental forcing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varying both candidate causes independently prevents either from being a proxy for the other. The interaction term directly tests whether the competitor modifies sensitivity to environmental forcing."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "候補の原因の両方を独立して変化させることで、どちらかが他方の代理となるのを防ぎます。相互作用項は、競合他社が環境強制に対する感性を修正するかどうかを直接テストします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vector v = (%lld, %lld) is reflected across the y-axis. Which component form matches the reflected diagram?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Vector v = (%1$lld, %2$lld) is reflected across the y-axis. Which component form matches the reflected diagram?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベクトル v = (%1$lld, %2$lld) は、y 軸を横切って反映されます。どのコンポーネントの形式が反射図と一致しますか?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vector v=(−3,4) is rotated 180° about the origin. Return v′.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vector v=(−3,4) is rotated 180° about the origin. Return v′."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベクトルv=(−3,4)は原点に対して180°回転します。v′を返す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vehicle-only negative, validated agonist positive, and mock-handled procedural controls, each tied to its distinct failure mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vehicle-only negative, validated agonist positive, and mock-handled procedural controls, each tied to its distinct failure mode."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "車両限定陰性、検証されたアゴニスト陽性、および模擬処理された手順制御は、それぞれ独自の障害モードに関連付けられています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification cannot be concluded from publication alone": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公開されたという事実だけから、検証済みとは結論づけられない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify both additive terms are minutes before substituting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verify both additive terms are minutes before substituting."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代入する前、両方の加法項が分であることを確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify in the original relation": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元のリレーションで検証する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify n = 1; assume the formula for k; add k + 1 and factor to obtain (k + 1)(k + 2)/2.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "n = 1 を確認し、k について式を仮定して k + 1 を加え、(k + 1)(k + 2)/2 を得るよう因数分解します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify n=1; assume the formula for k; add k+1 and factor to obtain (k+1)(k+2)/2.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verify n=1; assume the formula for k; add k+1 and factor to obtain (k+1)(k+2)/2."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "n=1を検証し、kの式と仮定し、k+1を加えて係数化すると、（k+1）（k+2）/2が得られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify prior equality": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "事前の等価性を検証する"
          }
        }
