          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warehouse volume=1,000 m³; even perfect packing gives 1,000/0.03≈33,333 boxes. Ten million exceeds that upper bound by about 300× (more than two orders of magnitude), so the claim is impossible under the stated dimensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warehouse volume=1,000 m³; even perfect packing gives 1,000/0.03≈33,333 boxes. Ten million exceeds that upper bound by about 300× (more than two orders of magnitude), so the claim is impossible under the stated dimensions."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "倉庫量=1,000m³；完璧な梱包でも1,000/0.03≈33,333箱。その上限を1千万を超えると約300×（2桁上回）になるため、記載した寸法では請求は不可能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch qualifiers such as may, under, if, and in this sample.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「可能性がある」「〜の条件下で」「もし」「この標本では」などの限定表現に注意してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
