    "Worst-case maximum = 20.0 + 0.2 + 35.0 + 0.3 = 55.5 mm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worst-case maximum = 20.0 + 0.2 + 35.0 + 0.3 = 55.5 mm."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最悪最大値=20.0 + 0.2 + 35.0 + 0.3 = 55.5 mm。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worst-case tolerances add, so the nominal stack is 55.0 mm with ±(0.2+0.3)=±0.5 mm. The complete interval is [54.5,55.5] mm; [54.8,55.2] drops one component’s possible deviation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worst-case tolerances add, so the nominal stack is 55.0 mm with ±(0.2+0.3)=±0.5 mm. The complete interval is [54.5,55.5] mm; [54.8,55.2] drops one component’s possible deviation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最悪の許容値が追加されるため、公称スタックは±(0.2+0.3)=±0.5 mmで55.0 mmです。完全間隔は[54.5,55.5] mmです。[54.8,55.2]はコンポーネントの可能な偏差を低下させます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write A implies B": {
