    "derive the derivative of $$f(x)=x^2$$. Show the cancellation that makes the limit finite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "derive the derivative of $$f(x)=x^2$$. Show the cancellation that makes the limit finite."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "$$f(x)=x^2$$の導関数を求め、極限を有限にする約分を示してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "det(A)=0 and x=(−2,1) lies in null(A).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "det(A)=0 and x=(−2,1) lies in null(A)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "det(A)=0で、x=(−2,1)はヌル(A)にあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "det(A)=1·4−2·2=0. Also A(−2,1)ᵀ=(0,0)ᵀ, so A has a nontrivial null vector and is singular.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "det(A)=1·4−2·2=0. Also A(−2,1)ᵀ=(0,0)ᵀ, so A has a nontrivial null vector and is singular."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "det(A)=1·4−2·2=0。また、A(−2,1)ᵀ=(0,0)ᵀなので、Aには非正規零ベクトルがあり、奇数です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "det(A)=1·4−2·3=−2. One row swap reverses the determinant’s sign, so the swapped matrix has determinant 2, not −2.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "det(A)=1·4−2·3=−2. One row swap reverses the determinant’s sign, so the swapped matrix has determinant 2, not −2."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "det(A)=1·4−2·3=−2。一列の交換は行列式の符号を反転させるため、交換された行列には符号2ではなく−2があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "detect leakage in preprocessing or feature construction, choose an appropriate split, and explain what the test result does and does not generalize to": {
      "localizations": {
