    "log₁₀(10)=1, so pH=4.76+1=5.76. It lies in the prompt’s conventional dilute-solution check range; that classroom range is not a universal physical bound for every concentrated aqueous solution.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "log₁₀(10)=1, so pH=4.76+1=5.76. It lies in the prompt’s conventional dilute-solution check range; that classroom range is not a universal physical bound for every concentrated aqueous solution."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "log₁₀(10)=1なので、pH=4.76+1=5.76。それはプロンプトの従来の希薄溶液チェック範囲にあります。その教室範囲は、すべての濃縮水溶液の普遍的な物理拘束ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
