    "η=Wout/Qin=240/800=0.30, which lies in [0,1]. An efficiency of 1.30 would claim 1.30 J of work per joule received and violate energy conservation for a heat engine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "η=Wout/Qin=240/800=0.30, which lies in [0,1]. An efficiency of 1.30 would claim 1.30 J of work per joule received and violate energy conservation for a heat engine."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "η=Wout/Qin=240/800=0.30、これは[0,1]にあります。効率1.30は受け取ったジュールあたり1.30Jの仕事を要求し、ヒートエンジンのエネルギー節約に違反します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘Both’ requires conjunction, so each verification must be true. The nearest distractor I∨A would grant access after only one check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "‘Both’ requires conjunction, so each verification must be true. The nearest distractor I∨A would grant access after only one check."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「両方」には接続詞が必要なので、各検証は真実でなければなりません。 I∨Aが与える最も近い干渉は、わずか1回のチェック後にアクセスを許可します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
